  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne222","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the TV; the baby is sleeping.","options":["turn down","turn up","turn on","turn over"],"answer":"turn down","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ the TV; the baby is sleeping. 宝宝睡觉，把电视“调小声”。 【语法点/词汇】turn down 调低；turn up 调高；turn on 打开；turn over 翻转。 【步骤】① sleeping → 调小 → turn down。② A. turn down ✓。③ B. turn up——错。④ C. turn on——错。⑤ D. turn over——错。 【答案】A. turn down。 【易错】turn off 与 turn down（本题 down 更贴“小声”）。 【口诀/模板句】baby sleeping turn down，音量调小别吵醒；turn up 调高 on 打开，over 翻转要分清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】孩子睡觉，调低音量turn down","【语法点/词汇】turn down 调低；turn up 调高；turn on 打开；turn over 翻转。","【步骤】① sleeping → 调小 → turn down。② A. turn down ✓。③ B. turn up——错。④ C. turn on——错。⑤ D. turn over——错。","【口诀/模板句】baby sleeping turn down，音量调小别吵醒；turn up 调高 on 打开，over 翻转要分清。","【答案】turn down"],"pitfalls":["选 turn up（调大音量，与宝宝睡觉语境相反）","选 turn on（打开，语境相反）","选 turn over（翻转）","不看后半句语境（宝宝在睡觉）就机械选 on/up"],"hint":"【结论】turn down 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为turn down。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne223","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The plane ____ on time despite the fog.","options":["took off","took up","took out","took over"],"answer":"took off","analysis":"【审题】题干：The plane ______ on time despite the fog. 飞机“起飞”on time。 【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞；take up 占据；take out 取出；take over 接管。 【步骤】① plane 起飞 → took off。② A. took off ✓。③ B. took up——错。④ C. took out——错。⑤ D. took over——错。 【答案】A. took off。 【易错】take 短语。 【口诀/模板句】plane took off 起飞了，on time 准时着；take off 起飞脱衣，despite fog 仍飞着。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】飞机起飞take off，过去","【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞；take up 占据；take out 取出；take over 接管。","【步骤】① plane 起飞 → took off。② A. took off ✓。③ B. took up——错。④ C. took out——错。⑤ D. took over——错。","【口诀/模板句】plane took off 起飞了，on time 准时着；take off 起飞脱衣，despite fog 仍飞着。","【答案】took off"],"pitfalls":["选 took up（占据/开始从事）","选 took out（取出）","选 took over（接管）","不知道 take off 有「起飞」的含义，与 plane 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】took off 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为took off。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne224","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a good habit of reading.","options":["developed","developed into","developing","development"],"answer":"developed","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ a good habit of reading. “养成”好习惯。 【语法点/词汇】develop a habit（养成习惯）；develop into 发展成；developing 现在分词；development 名词。 【步骤】① develop a habit。② A. developed ✓。③ B. developed into——需宾语“成……”，错。④ C. developing——缺谓语，错。⑤ D. development——名词，错。 【答案】A. developed。 【易错】develop/develop into。 【口诀/模板句】develop a habit 养成习，develop into 成长成；developed 过去式，养成习惯 of reading。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】develop habit养成习惯，developed","【语法点/词汇】develop a habit（养成习惯）；develop into 发展成；developing 现在分词；development 名词。","【步骤】① develop a habit。② A. developed ✓。③ B. developed into——需宾语“成……”，错。④ C. developing——缺谓语，错。⑤ D. development——名词，错。","【口诀/模板句】develop a habit 养成习，develop into 成长成；developed 过去式，养成习惯 of reading。","【答案】developed"],"pitfalls":["选 developed into（意为「发展成」，后接名词）","选 developing（进行时/分词，与过去完成的语义不符）","选 development（名词，不能作谓语）","不知道 develop a habit 是「养成习惯」的固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】developed 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为developed。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne225","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"We should ____ good habits.","options":["form","build","make","do"],"answer":"form","analysis":"【审题】题干：We should ______ good habits. “养成”好习惯。 【语法点/词汇】form/develop good habits；build 一般不与 habits 搭；make 也少见；do 不搭。 【步骤】① form habits（养成习惯）。② A. form ✓。③ B. build——build habits 非标准，错。④ C. make——make habits 不自然，错。⑤ D. do——错。 【答案】A. form。 【易错】form/build/make 混。 【口诀/模板句】form/develop a habit 养成习，form habits 固定语；build make 不搭 habit，form good habits 最相宜。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】form good habits养成好习惯，form","【语法点/词汇】form/develop good habits；build 一般不与 habits 搭；make 也少见；do 不搭。","【步骤】① form habits（养成习惯）。② A. form ✓。③ B. build——build habits 非标准，错。④ C. make——make habits 不自然，错。⑤ D. do——错。","【口诀/模板句】form/develop a habit 养成习，form habits 固定语；build make 不搭 habit，form good habits 最相宜。","【答案】form"],"pitfalls":["选 build（build habits 不如 form habits 地道，本题考固定搭配）","选 make（make habits 不表「养成」）","选 do（do habits 不成立）","不知道 form a habit（养成习惯）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】form 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为form。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne226","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He was ____ of the danger.","options":["aware","awake","award","away"],"answer":"aware","analysis":"【审题】题干：He was ______ of the danger. “意识到”危险。 【语法点/词汇】be aware of（意识到）；awake 醒着；award 奖；away 离开。 【步骤】① aware of the danger。② A. aware ✓。③ B. awake——醒着，错。④ C. award——名词，错。⑤ D. away——副词，错。 【答案】A. aware。 【易错】aware/awake。 【口诀/模板句】aware of 意识到，danger 前 be aware；awake 醒着 award 奖，aware of danger 最要。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be aware of意识到，aware","【语法点/词汇】be aware of（意识到）；awake 醒着；award 奖；away 离开。","【步骤】① aware of the danger。② A. aware ✓。③ B. awake——醒着，错。④ C. award——名词，错。⑤ D. away——副词，错。","【口诀/模板句】aware of 意识到，danger 前 be aware；awake 醒着 award 奖，aware of danger 最要。","【答案】aware"],"pitfalls":["选 awake（意为「醒着的」，不能与 of 搭配）","选 award（名词/动词，意为「奖项/授予」）","选 away（副词，意为「离开」）","不知道 be aware of 意为「意识到」，是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】aware 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为aware。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne227","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book ____ 5 chapters.","options":["consists of","consists in","makes up","composes"],"answer":"consists of","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book ______ 5 chapters. “由……组成”。 【语法点/词汇】consist of（由……组成）；consist in 在于；make up 组成（主语是部分）；compose 编写。 【步骤】① 书包括5章 → consists of。② A. consists of ✓。③ B. consists in——在于，错。④ C. makes up——主语应是“5章构成书”，错。⑤ D. composes——compose of 不这样用，错。 【答案】A. consists of。 【易错】consist of/in；make up 方向。 【口诀/模板句】consist of 由组成，consist in 在于理；make up 部分组成整体，book consists of 5 chapters。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】consist of包含，由……组成","【语法点/词汇】consist of（由……组成）；consist in 在于；make up 组成（主语是部分）；compose 编写。","【步骤】① 书包括5章 → consists of。② A. consists of ✓。③ B. consists in——在于，错。④ C. makes up——主语应是“5章构成书”，错。⑤ D. composes——compose of 不这样用，错。","【口诀/模板句】consist of 由组成，consist in 在于理；make up 部分组成整体，book consists of 5 chapters。","【答案】consists of"],"pitfalls":["选 consists in（意为「在于」，后接抽象事物）","选 makes up（需用被动 be made up of 才能表构成）","选 composes（compose 的主语应是部分而非整体）","不知道 consist of 意为「由…组成」，主语是整体"],"hint":"【结论】consists of 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为consists of。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne228","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his opinion at the meeting.","options":["expressed","expressed himself","expressive","expression"],"answer":"expressed","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ his opinion at the meeting. “表达”观点。 【语法点/词汇】express one's opinion；express oneself 表达自己。 【步骤】① express his opinion。② A. expressed ✓。③ B. expressed himself——后应无 opinion 或为表达自己，结构冲突，错。④ C. expressive——形容词，错。⑤ D. expression——名词，错。 【答案】A. expressed。 【易错】express oneself 与 express one's opinion。 【口诀/模板句】express one's opinion 表观点，express oneself 表自己；opinion 前用 expressed，表达观点 his opinion。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】express opinion表达观点，expressed","【语法点/词汇】express one's opinion；express oneself 表达自己。","【步骤】① express his opinion。② A. expressed ✓。③ B. expressed himself——后应无 opinion 或为表达自己，结构冲突，错。④ C. expressive——形容词，错。⑤ D. expression——名词，错。","【口诀/模板句】express one's opinion 表观点，express oneself 表自己；opinion 前用 expressed，表达观点 his opinion。","【答案】expressed"],"pitfalls":["选 expressed himself（多加了宾语，本题已经有 his opinion）","选 expressive（形容词，不能作谓语）","选 expression（名词，不能作谓语）","看不出空格需要一个及物动词，后接宾语 his opinion"],"hint":"【结论】expressed 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为expressed。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne229","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I can't ____ his name at the moment.","options":["recall","remind","remember to","memory"],"answer":"recall","analysis":"【审题】题干：I can't ______ his name at the moment. “想起”名字。 【语法点/词汇】recall 回想起；remind 提醒（人）；remember to do 记得去做；memory 名词。 【步骤】① 想起名字 → recall。② A. recall ✓。③ B. remind——remind sb. of，错。④ C. remember to——后应接动词，结构不全，错。⑤ D. memory——名词，错。 【答案】A. recall。 【易错】recall/remind/remember。 【口诀/模板句】recall 想起某事，remind 提醒某人；remember to do 记去做，can't recall his name。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】recall回忆，想不起名字","【语法点/词汇】recall 回想起；remind 提醒（人）；remember to do 记得去做；memory 名词。","【步骤】① 想起名字 → recall。② A. recall ✓。③ B. remind——remind sb. of，错。④ C. remember to——后应接动词，结构不全，错。⑤ D. memory——名词，错。","【口诀/模板句】recall 想起某事，remind 提醒某人；remember to do 记去做，can't recall his name。","【答案】recall"],"pitfalls":["选 remind（remind 意为「提醒」，不是「回忆起」）","选 remember to（remember to do 后接动词，不能接名词 name）","选 memory（名词，不能作谓语）","不知道 recall 意为「回想起」，可直接接名词作宾语"],"hint":"【结论】recall 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为recall。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne230","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ me to post the letter.","options":["remind","remember","recall","memory"],"answer":"remind","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ me to post the letter. “提醒”我寄信。 【语法点/词汇】remind sb. to do（提醒某人做）。 【步骤】① remind me to post。② A. remind ✓。③ B. remember——remember to do 是自己记得，错。④ C. recall——想起，错。⑤ D. memory——名词，错。 【答案】A. remind。 【易错】remind/remember。 【口诀/模板句】remind sb. to do 提醒，remember to do 自己记；Please remind me to post，提醒寄信用 remind。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】remind sb to do，提醒某人","【语法点/词汇】remind sb. to do（提醒某人做）。","【步骤】① remind me to post。② A. remind ✓。③ B. remember——remember to do 是自己记得，错。④ C. recall——想起，错。⑤ D. memory——名词，错。","【口诀/模板句】remind sb. to do 提醒，remember to do 自己记；Please remind me to post，提醒寄信用 remind。","【答案】remind"],"pitfalls":["选 remember（remember sb to do 结构不成立）","选 recall（recall 意为「回想起」，不表「提醒」）","选 memory（名词，不能作谓语）","不知道 remind sb to do sth 是「提醒某人做某事」的固定句型"],"hint":"【结论】remind 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为remind。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne231","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a lot of time on the project.","options":["spent","took","cost","paid"],"answer":"spent","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ a lot of time on the project. spend time on sth. 【语法点/词汇】spend + 时间/钱 + on sth. / (in) doing。 【步骤】① He spent time on the project。② A. spent ✓。③ B. took——It took him time，主语应是 It，错。④ C. cost——物 cost 钱，错。⑤ D. paid——人 pay 钱 for，错。 【答案】A. spent。 【易错】四花费混用。 【口诀/模板句】spend 人 time/money on，took It 开头；cost 物值 paid 人 for，spent on project。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】spend time on，人花时间","【语法点/词汇】spend + 时间/钱 + on sth. / (in) doing。","【步骤】① He spent time on the project。② A. spent ✓。③ B. took——It took him time，主语应是 It，错。④ C. cost——物 cost 钱，错。⑤ D. paid——人 pay 钱 for，错。","【口诀/模板句】spend 人 time/money on，took It 开头；cost 物值 paid 人 for，spent on project。","【答案】spent"],"pitfalls":["选 took（It takes sb time 结构，本题主语是人）","选 cost（cost 的主语是物，结构是 sth costs sb + 钱）","选 paid（pay 搭配 pay for，不能直接接 time on）","不知道 spend + 时间/钱 + on sth 这个固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】spent 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为spent。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne232","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The house ____ him 2 million yuan.","options":["cost","spent","took","paid"],"answer":"cost","analysis":"【审题】题干：The house ______ him 2 million yuan. 物“花费”某人多少钱。 【语法点/词汇】sth. cost sb. money。 【步骤】① The house cost him。② A. cost ✓。③ B. spent——人 spend，错。④ C. took——It took sb. time/money 少见且主语 It，错。⑤ D. paid——人 pay，错。 【答案】A. cost。 【易错】cost/spend。 【口诀/模板句】物 cost 人钱，The house cost him；人 spend 物 cost，主语定动词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】cost主语物，房子花了他","【语法点/词汇】sth. cost sb. money。","【步骤】① The house cost him。② A. cost ✓。③ B. spent——人 spend，错。④ C. took——It took sb. time/money 少见且主语 It，错。⑤ D. paid——人 pay，错。","【口诀/模板句】物 cost 人钱，The house cost him；人 spend 物 cost，主语定动词。","【答案】cost"],"pitfalls":["选 spent（spend 的主语必须是人）","选 took（It takes sb 结构，本题主语是物 house）","选 paid（pay 的主语是人，且要接 for）","不知道 sth costs sb + 钱 这个固定句型"],"hint":"【结论】cost 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为cost。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne233","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ 100 yuan for the book.","options":["paid","spent","cost","took"],"answer":"paid","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ 100 yuan for the book. pay money for sth. 【语法点/词汇】pay + 钱 + for sth.。 【步骤】① I paid 100 yuan for。② A. paid ✓。③ B. spent——I spent 100 yuan on the book，介词不同，错。④ C. cost——物 cost，错。⑤ D. took——错。 【答案】A. paid。 【易错】pay for 与 spend on。 【口诀/模板句】pay 钱 for 物，spend 钱 on 物；I paid 100 yuan for the book，介词 for 跟 pay。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】pay for付钱","【语法点/词汇】pay + 钱 + for sth.。","【步骤】① I paid 100 yuan for。② A. paid ✓。③ B. spent——I spent 100 yuan on the book，介词不同，错。④ C. cost——物 cost，错。⑤ D. took——错。","【口诀/模板句】pay 钱 for 物，spend 钱 on 物；I paid 100 yuan for the book，介词 for 跟 pay。","【答案】paid"],"pitfalls":["选 spent（spend 搭配 on sth，本题有 for the book）","选 cost（cost 的主语是物）","选 took（It takes sb to do 结构，不符合本题）","不知道 pay 钱 for sth 是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】paid 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为paid。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne234","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"It ____ me 2 hours to finish it.","options":["took","spent","cost","paid"],"answer":"took","analysis":"【审题】题干：It ______ me 2 hours to finish it. It took sb. time to do。 【语法点/词汇】took。 【步骤】① It took me 2 hours to finish。② A. took ✓。③ B. spent——主语 I，错。④ C. cost——物，错。⑤ D. paid——人 for，错。 【答案】A. took。 【易错】took/spent。 【口诀/模板句】It took me 2 hours，to finish 是后补；spend 主语才是人，took It 开头最稳。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】It takes sb time，花时间","【语法点/词汇】took。","【步骤】① It took me 2 hours to finish。② A. took ✓。③ B. spent——主语 I，错。④ C. cost——物，错。⑤ D. paid——人 for，错。","【口诀/模板句】It took me 2 hours，to finish 是后补；spend 主语才是人，took It 开头最稳。","【答案】took"],"pitfalls":["选 spent（主语必须是人）","选 cost（cost 的主语是物）","选 paid（pay 的主语是人，且需接 for）","不掌握 It takes sb + 时间 + to do sth 句型"],"hint":"【结论】took 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为took。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne235","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his best to help me.","options":["did","made","took","had"],"answer":"did","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ his best to help me. do one's best（尽最大努力）。 【语法点/词汇】do one's best to do；make 无此搭配。 【步骤】① do his best。② A. did ✓。③ B. made——make one's best 不成立，错。④ C. took——错。⑤ D. had——错。 【答案】A. did。 【易错】make one's best。 【口诀/模板句】do one's best 尽力做，did his best to help；固定搭配 do best，make best 不对路。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】do one's best尽力，did","【语法点/词汇】do one's best to do；make 无此搭配。","【步骤】① do his best。② A. did ✓。③ B. made——make one's best 不成立，错。④ C. took——错。⑤ D. had——错。","【口诀/模板句】do one's best 尽力做，did his best to help；固定搭配 do best，make best 不对路。","【答案】did"],"pitfalls":["选 made（make one's best 不是标准搭配）","选 took（take one's best 不成立）","选 had（had one's best 不成立）","不知道 do one's best（尽最大努力）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】did 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为did。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne236","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ him sinwe graduated.","options":["haven't seen","didn't see","don't see","hadn't seen"],"answer":"haven't seen","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ him sinwe graduated. sin现在完成时。 【语法点/词汇】haven't seen（否定完成）。 【步骤】① sin→ 现在完成。② A. haven't seen ✓。③ B. didn't see——过去，错。④ C. don't see——现在，错。⑤ D. hadn't seen——过去完成，错。 【答案】A. haven't seen。 【易错】sin用过去式。 【口诀/模板句】sin配完成时，haven't seen 否定式；sinwe graduated，从毕业至今没见。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】since毕业，现在完成否定haven't seen","【语法点/词汇】haven't seen（否定完成）。","【步骤】① since → 现在完成。② A. haven't seen ✓。③ B. didn't see——过去，错。④ C. don't see——现在，错。⑤ D. hadn't seen——过去完成，错。","【口诀/模板句】since 配完成时，haven't seen 否定式；since we graduated，从毕业至今没见。","【答案】haven't seen"],"pitfalls":["选 didn't see（一般过去时无法与 since 从句表持续到现在搭配）","选 don't see（一般现在时不能表达延续至今的状态）","选 hadn't seen（过去完成时需要过去的时间参照点）","不知道 since + 从句（过去时）要求主句用现在完成时"],"hint":"【结论】haven't seen 【考点】时态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：时态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为haven't seen。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne237","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Look at the dark clouds. It ____ rain.","options":["is going to","will","shall","would"],"answer":"is going to","analysis":"【审题】题干：Look at the dark clouds. It ______ rain. 有迹象（乌云）表明即将下雨，用 be going to。 【语法点/词汇】be going to 有迹象/计划；will 临时决定/预测。 【步骤】① 乌云是迹象。② A. is going to ✓。③ B. will——无迹象时用，错。④ C. shall——第一人称征求意见，错。⑤ D. would——过去将来，错。 【答案】A. is going to。 【易错】will/be going to。 【口诀/模板句】迹象明显 going to，临时决定用 will；dark clouds 是迹象，is going to rain。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】乌云预示，be going to","【语法点/词汇】be going to 有迹象/计划；will 临时决定/预测。","【步骤】① 乌云是迹象。② A. is going to ✓。③ B. will——无迹象时用，错。④ C. shall——第一人称征求意见，错。⑤ D. would——过去将来，错。","【口诀/模板句】迹象明显 going to，临时决定用 will；dark clouds 是迹象，is going to rain。","【答案】is going to"],"pitfalls":["选 will（无迹象的将来用 will，但有明显迹象时用 be going to）","选 shall（只用于第一人称）","选 would（过去将来，与现在语境不符）","看不出 Look at the dark clouds 是「有迹象的推测」，应用 be going to"],"hint":"【结论】is going to 【考点】时态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：时态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为is going to。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne238","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"语态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The work ____ well.","options":["is done","is doing","does","did"],"answer":"is done","analysis":"【审题】题干：The work ______ well. 工作被做得好，被动。 【语法点/词汇】is done（be + 过去分词）。 【步骤】① 工作被做 → is done。② A. is done ✓。③ B. is doing——主动进行，错。④ C. does——主动，错。⑤ D. did——过去主动，错。 【答案】A. is done。 【易错】is done 与 is doing。 【口诀/模板句】work is done well，被动语态 be done；工作被做好 is done，主动被动要分清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["语态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】工作被做，被动is done","【语法点/词汇】is done（be + 过去分词）。","【步骤】① 工作被做 → is done。② A. is done ✓。③ B. is doing——主动进行，错。④ C. does——主动，错。⑤ D. did——过去主动，错。","【口诀/模板句】work is done well，被动语态 be done；工作被做好 is done，主动被动要分清。","【答案】is done"],"pitfalls":["选 is doing（主动进行，但 work 是被做的）","选 does（主动且一般现在时，语态不符）","选 did（过去时主动，语态时态都错）","看不出 work 与 do 是被动关系"],"hint":"【结论】is done 【考点】语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：语态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为is done。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne239","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ have told me earlier.","options":["should","would","could","might"],"answer":"should","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ have told me earlier. “本应该早点告诉我”（责备），should have done。 【语法点/词汇】should have done 本该做（实际没做）。 【步骤】① 责备“本应早说”→ should have told。② A. should ✓。③ B. would——would have done 虚拟，错。④ C. could——could have done 本能够，错。⑤ D. might——might have done 可能做过，错。 【答案】A. should。 【易错】should have done 否定形式 needn't have done。 【口诀/模板句】should have done 本该做，本不该 needn't have；could have 本能够，would have 虚拟说。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】should have done本应该，should","【语法点/词汇】should have done 本该做（实际没做）。","【步骤】① 责备“本应早说”→ should have told。② A. should ✓。③ B. would——would have done 虚拟，错。④ C. could——could have done 本能够，错。⑤ D. might——might have done 可能做过，错。","【口诀/模板句】should have done 本该做，本不该 needn't have；could have 本能够，would have 虚拟说。","【答案】should"],"pitfalls":["选 would（would have done 表虚拟假设，本题是责备）","选 could（could have done 表本能够，语义不符）","选 might（表推测可能，不表责备）","不知道 should have done 表示「本应该做而没做」的责备"],"hint":"【结论】should 【考点】情态动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：情态动词。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为should。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne240","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"You ____ have told me; I already knew.","options":["needn't","mustn't","can't","may not"],"answer":"needn't","analysis":"【审题】题干：You ______ have told me; I already knew. “你本不必告诉我”（我已经知道了）。 【语法点/词汇】needn't have done 本不必做（实际做了）。 【步骤】① already knew → 本不必说。② A. needn't ✓。③ B. mustn't——禁止，错。④ C. can't——不可能，错。⑤ D. may not——可能不，错。 【答案】A. needn't。 【易错】needn't have done 与 mustn't。 【口诀/模板句】needn't have done 本不必，做了却说不必；mustn't 禁止 can't 不可能，needn't 最合 already knew。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】needn't have done本不必，needn't","【语法点/词汇】needn't have done 本不必做（实际做了）。","【步骤】① already knew → 本不必说。② A. needn't ✓。③ B. mustn't——禁止，错。④ C. can't——不可能，错。⑤ D. may not——可能不，错。","【口诀/模板句】needn't have done 本不必，做了却说不必；mustn't 禁止 can't 不可能，needn't 最合 already knew。","【答案】needn't"],"pitfalls":["选 mustn't（表「禁止」，不用于 have done 结构）","选 can't（can't have done 表「不可能做过」）","选 may not（表「也许没」，与「我已知道了」不符）","不知道 needn't have done 表示「本不必做却做了」"],"hint":"【结论】needn't 【考点】情态动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：情态动词。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为needn't。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne242","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"____ you work hard, you will succeed.","options":["As long as","As soon as","As well as","As much as"],"answer":"As long as","analysis":"【审题】题干：______ you work hard, you will succeed. “只要”努力就成功。 【语法点/词汇】as long as 只要；as soon as 一……就……；as well as 也；as much as 尽量。 【步骤】① 条件“只要”→ As long as。② A. As long as ✓。③ B. As soon as——时间，错。④ C. As well as——并列，错。⑤ D. As much as——程度，错。 【答案】A. As long as。 【易错】as 短语从句混。 【口诀/模板句】as long as 只要，as soon as 就；as well as 并列，as much as 尽量留；只要努力 succeed，As long as 条件。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】as long as只要，条件","【语法点/词汇】as long as 只要；as soon as 一……就……；as well as 也；as much as 尽量。","【步骤】① 条件“只要”→ As long as。② A. As long as ✓。③ B. As soon as——时间，错。④ C. As well as——并列，错。⑤ D. As much as——程度，错。","【口诀/模板句】as long as 只要，as soon as 就；as well as 并列，as much as 尽量留；只要努力 succeed，As long as 条件。","【答案】As long as"],"pitfalls":["选 As soon as（表「一…就」，时间关系）","选 As well as（表「和/也」，并列关系）","选 As much as（表比较）","读不出「只要你努力」是条件关系，应用 as long as"],"hint":"【结论】As long as 【考点】状语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：状语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为As long as。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne243","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I have a lot of homework ____ tonight.","options":["to do","doing","done","do"],"answer":"to do","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have a lot of homework ______ tonight. have sth. to do。 【语法点/词汇】to do。 【步骤】① homework to do。② A. to do ✓。③ B. doing——错。④ C. done——错。⑤ D. do——错。 【答案】A. to do。 【易错】have sth. doing/done。 【口诀/模板句】have homework to do 有作业做，tonight 将要做；to do 后置定语，不定式要记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】have sth to do，to do","【语法点/词汇】to do。","【步骤】① homework to do。② A. to do ✓。③ B. doing——错。④ C. done——错。⑤ D. do——错。","【口诀/模板句】have homework to do 有作业做，tonight 将要做；to do 后置定语，不定式要记住。","【答案】to do"],"pitfalls":["选 doing（have sth to do 结构中要用不定式）","选 done（过去分词不合结构）","选 do（缺 to）","不知道 have sth to do 是固定结构，表示「有…要做」"],"hint":"【结论】to do 【考点】非谓语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：非谓语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为to do。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne256","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is ____ about the result.","options":["anxious","anxiety","anxiously","anxiousness"],"answer":"anxious","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ______ about the result. be 后形容词。 【语法点/词汇】anxious（焦虑的）形容词；anxiety 名词；anxiously 副词；anxiousness 名词。 【步骤】① be + 形容词。② A. anxious ✓。③ B. anxiety——名词，错。④ C. anxiously——副词，错。⑤ D. anxiousness——名词，错。 【答案】A. anxious。 【易错】词形家族。 【口诀/模板句】anxious 形容焦虑，be anxious about 结果；anxiety 名词 anxiously 副，词性判断要记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be anxious about，形容词anxious","【语法点/词汇】anxious（焦虑的）形容词；anxiety 名词；anxiously 副词；anxiousness 名词。","【步骤】① be + 形容词。② A. anxious ✓。③ B. anxiety——名词，错。④ C. anxiously——副词，错。⑤ D. anxiousness——名词，错。","【口诀/模板句】anxious 形容焦虑，be anxious about 结果；anxiety 名词 anxiously 副，词性判断要记住。","【答案】anxious"],"pitfalls":["选 anxiety（名词，不能作 is 后的表语）","选 anxiously（副词，不能作表语）","选 anxiousness（名词，词性不符）","不知道 be anxious about 中要填形容词"],"hint":"【结论】anxious 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为anxious。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne257","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The film ____ me deeply.","options":["impressed","impression","impressive","impressively"],"answer":"impressed","analysis":"【审题】题干：The film ______ me deeply. 谓语动词“打动”。 【语法点/词汇】impress 打动，过去式 impressed；impression 名词；impressive 形容词；impressively 副词。 【步骤】① 谓语动词。② A. impressed ✓。③ B. impression——名词，错。④ C. impressive——形容词，错。⑤ D. impressively——副词，错。 【答案】A. impressed。 【易错】词性。 【口诀/模板句】film impressed me，打动用动词过去式；impression 名词 impressive 形，句子缺谓语选动词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】impress动词，电影打动我impressed","【语法点/词汇】impress 打动，过去式 impressed；impression 名词；impressive 形容词；impressively 副词。","【步骤】① 谓语动词。② A. impressed ✓。③ B. impression——名词，错。④ C. impressive——形容词，错。⑤ D. impressively——副词，错。","【口诀/模板句】film impressed me，打动用动词过去式；impression 名词 impressive 形，句子缺谓语选动词。","【答案】impressed"],"pitfalls":["选 impression（名词，不能作谓语）","选 impressive（形容词，不能带宾语 me）","选 impressively（副词，不能作谓语）","看不出此处需要及物动词，后接宾语 me"],"hint":"【结论】impressed 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为impressed。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne258","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He was ____ of his mistakes.","options":["conscious","consciousness","consciously","conscience"],"answer":"conscious","analysis":"【审题】题干：He was ______ of his mistakes. be + 形容词 + of。 【语法点/词汇】be conscious of（意识到）；consciousness 名词；consciously 副词；conscien良心。 【步骤】① be conscious of。② A. conscious ✓。③ B. consciousness——名词，错。④ C. consciously——副词，错。⑤ D. conscience——名词，错。 【答案】A. conscious。 【易错】conscious/conscience。 【口诀/模板句】conscious of 意识到，be conscious of mistakes；conscien良心是名词，词性辨析要仔细。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be conscious of意识到，conscious","【语法点/词汇】be conscious of（意识到）；consciousness 名词；consciously 副词；conscience 良心。","【步骤】① be conscious of。② A. conscious ✓。③ B. consciousness——名词，错。④ C. consciously——副词，错。⑤ D. conscience——名词，错。","【口诀/模板句】conscious of 意识到，be conscious of mistakes；conscience 良心是名词，词性辨析要仔细。","【答案】conscious"],"pitfalls":["选 consciousness（名词，不能作表语）","选 consciously（副词，不能作表语）","选 conscience（名词，意为「良心」，与 of 搭配不当）","不知道 be conscious of 意为「意识到」，是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】conscious 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为conscious。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne259","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I can't ____ the meaning of this word.","options":["figure out","figure on","figure in","figure up"],"answer":"figure out","analysis":"【审题】题干：I can't ______ the meaning of this word. “弄明白”意思。 【语法点/词汇】figure out 弄明白；figure on 打算；figure in 算进；figure up 计算总和。 【步骤】① figure out the meaning。② A. figure out ✓。③ B. figure on——打算，错。④ C. figure in——错。⑤ D. figure up——错。 【答案】A. figure out。 【易错】figure 短语。 【口诀/模板句】figure out 弄明白，figure on 打算来；figure in 算进去 figure up 算总，figure out meaning。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】figure out弄明白","【语法点/词汇】figure out 弄明白；figure on 打算；figure in 算进；figure up 计算总和。","【步骤】① figure out the meaning。② A. figure out ✓。③ B. figure on——打算，错。④ C. figure in——错。⑤ D. figure up——错。","【口诀/模板句】figure out 弄明白，figure on 打算来；figure in 算进去 figure up 算总，figure out meaning。","【答案】figure out"],"pitfalls":["选 figure on（意为「指望」）","选 figure in（意为「把…计算在内」）","选 figure up（意为「合计」）","不知道 figure out 意为「弄明白、理解」"],"hint":"【结论】figure out 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为figure out。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne260","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ me a favor.","options":["do","make","take","give"],"answer":"do","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ me a favor. do sb. a favor（帮某人忙）。 【语法点/词汇】do a favor。 【步骤】① do me a favor。② A. do ✓。③ B. make——make 不搭 favor，错。④ C. take——错。⑤ D. give——错。 【答案】A. do。 【易错】make a favor。 【口诀/模板句】do sb. a favor 帮个忙，do me a favor 是常用；make take give 不搭，do favor 记心上。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】do sb a favor帮忙，固定","【语法点/词汇】do a favor。","【步骤】① do me a favor。② A. do ✓。③ B. make——make 不搭 favor，错。④ C. take——错。⑤ D. give——错。","【口诀/模板句】do sb. a favor 帮个忙，do me a favor 是常用；make take give 不搭，do favor 记心上。","【答案】do"],"pitfalls":["选 make（make a favor 不成立，应为 make a favor 之外的说法）","选 take（take a favor 不成立）","选 give（give me a favor 不是标准搭配）","不知道 do sb a favor（帮某人一个忙）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】do 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为do。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne261","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a living by teaching.","options":["makes","does","takes","gets"],"answer":"makes","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ a living by teaching. make a living（谋生）。 【语法点/词汇】make a living by doing。 【步骤】① makes a living。② A. makes ✓。③ B. does——错。④ C. takes——错。⑤ D. gets——get a living 少见，错。 【答案】A. makes。 【易错】make/do a living。 【口诀/模板句】make a living 谋生计，by teaching 方式清；make a living by doing，do get take 不行。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make a living谋生，固定","【语法点/词汇】make a living by doing。","【步骤】① makes a living。② A. makes ✓。③ B. does——错。④ C. takes——错。⑤ D. gets——get a living 少见，错。","【口诀/模板句】make a living 谋生计，by teaching 方式清；make a living by doing，do get take 不行。","【答案】makes"],"pitfalls":["选 does（do a living 不成立）","选 takes（take a living 不成立）","选 gets（get a living 不是标准表达）","不知道 make a living（谋生）是固定搭配，主语单数要加 s"],"hint":"【结论】makes 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为makes。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne262","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ a photo of the document.","options":["make","take","do","get"],"answer":"take","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ a photo of the document. take a photo（拍照）。 【语法点/词汇】take a photo/picture；make a photo 不成立。 【步骤】① take a photo。② A. make——错。③ B. take ✓。④ C. do——错。⑤ D. get——错。 【答案】B. take。 【易错】make a photo。 【口诀/模板句】take a photo 拍张照，take a picture 也同理；make do get 不搭 photo，take photo 记心里。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】take a photo拍照，固定","【语法点/词汇】take a photo/picture；make a photo 不成立。","【步骤】① take a photo。② A. make——错。③ B. take ✓。④ C. do——错。⑤ D. get——错。","【口诀/模板句】take a photo 拍张照，take a picture 也同理；make do get 不搭 photo，take photo 记心里。","【答案】take"],"pitfalls":["选 make（make a photo 不成立）","选 do（do a photo 不成立）","选 get（get a photo 不表「拍照」）","不知道 take a photo（拍照）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】take 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为take。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne263","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He was ____ in the rain.","options":["caught","catching","catch","catches"],"answer":"caught","analysis":"【审题】题干：He was ______ in the rain. be caught in the rain（被雨淋/遇雨）。 【语法点/词汇】be caught in（被困在）。 【步骤】① be caught in the rain。② A. caught ✓。③ B. catching——主动，错。④ C. catch——原形，错。⑤ D. catches——三单，错。 【答案】A. caught。 【易错】be caught in 与 be catching。 【口诀/模板句】be caught in the rain 遇雨，caught 过去分词被动；was caught in 固定，caught in rain 最有趣。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be caught in遭遇雨，caught","【语法点/词汇】be caught in（被困在）。","【步骤】① be caught in the rain。② A. caught ✓。③ B. catching——主动，错。④ C. catch——原形，错。⑤ D. catches——三单，错。","【口诀/模板句】be caught in the rain 遇雨，caught 过去分词被动；was caught in 固定，caught in rain 最有趣。","【答案】caught"],"pitfalls":["选 catching（be catching 不是被动结构）","选 catch（原形不能跟在 was 后）","选 catches（第三人称单数形式不合）","看不出 was + 过去分词 构成被动，be caught in the rain 是固定表达"],"hint":"【结论】caught 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为caught。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne264","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I am ____ looking forward to the trip.","options":["really","real","reality","realize"],"answer":"really","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am ______ looking forward to the trip. 修饰 looking forward 用副词。 【语法点/词汇】really 副词“真的”；real 形容词；reality 名词；realize 动词。 【步骤】① 修饰动词短语用副词。② A. really ✓。③ B. real——形容词，错。④ C. reality——名词，错。⑤ D. realize——动词，错。 【答案】A. really。 【易错】real/really。 【口诀/模板句】really 副词修动词，I am really looking forward；real 形容 reality 名，词性位置要清楚。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】副词修饰looking forward，really","【语法点/词汇】really 副词“真的”；real 形容词；reality 名词；realize 动词。","【步骤】① 修饰动词短语用副词。② A. really ✓。③ B. real——形容词，错。④ C. reality——名词，错。⑤ D. realize——动词，错。","【口诀/模板句】really 副词修动词，I am really looking forward；real 形容 reality 名，词性位置要清楚。","【答案】really"],"pitfalls":["选 real（形容词不能修饰动词 looking）","选 reality（名词，词性不符）","选 realize（动词，不能修饰 looking）","不知道修饰动词要用副词 really"],"hint":"【结论】really 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为really。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne265","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He made a ____ contribution to the project.","options":["significant","significance","significantly","signify"],"answer":"significant","analysis":"【审题】题干：He made a ______ contribution to the project. 名词 contribution 前用形容词。 【语法点/词汇】significant 形容词“重大的”；significan名词；significantly 副词；signify 动词。 【步骤】① a ______ contribution，定语形容词。② A. significant ✓。③ B. significance——名词，错。④ C. significantly——副词，错。⑤ D. signify——动词，错。 【答案】A. significant。 【易错】词性。 【口诀/模板句】significant 形容重大，a significant contribution；significan名词 significantly 副，名词前面用形容。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】形容词significant修饰contribution","【语法点/词汇】significant 形容词“重大的”；significance 名词；significantly 副词；signify 动词。","【步骤】① a ______ contribution，定语形容词。② A. significant ✓。③ B. significance——名词，错。④ C. significantly——副词，错。⑤ D. signify——动词，错。","【口诀/模板句】significant 形容重大，a significant contribution；significance 名词 significantly 副，名词前面用形容。","【答案】significant"],"pitfalls":["选 significance（名词，不能修饰名词 contribution）","选 significantly（副词，不能修饰名词）","选 signify（动词，词性不符）","不知道空格要修饰名词 contribution，必须用形容词"],"hint":"【结论】significant 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为significant。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne266","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The ____ of the story is that honesty is the best policy.","options":["moral","morale","moralize","morally"],"answer":"moral","analysis":"【审题】题干：The ______ of the story is that honesty is the best policy. 故事的“寓意”。 【语法点/词汇】moral 寓意/道德；morale 士气；moralize 说教；morally 副词。 【步骤】① the moral of the story（故事寓意）。② A. moral ✓。③ B. morale——士气，错。④ C. moralize——动词，错。⑤ D. morally——副词，错。 【答案】A. moral。 【易错】moral/morale。 【口诀/模板句】the moral of the story 寓意，honesty is the best policy；morale 士气 moralize 说，寓意名词 moral。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】moral寓意，故事的教训","【语法点/词汇】moral 寓意/道德；morale 士气；moralize 说教；morally 副词。","【步骤】① the moral of the story（故事寓意）。② A. moral ✓。③ B. morale——士气，错。④ C. moralize——动词，错。⑤ D. morally——副词，错。","【口诀/模板句】the moral of the story 寓意，honesty is the best policy；morale 士气 moralize 说，寓意名词 moral。","【答案】moral"],"pitfalls":["选 morale（名词，意为「士气」，与故事寓意无关）","选 moralize（动词，不能作主语）","选 morally（副词，不能作 The 后的名词）","不知道 the moral of the story 意为「故事的寓意」"],"hint":"【结论】moral 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为moral。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne267","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ his opinion on the matter.","options":["expressed","explained","exposed","explored"],"answer":"expressed","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ his opinion on the matter. “表达”观点。 【语法点/词汇】express one's opinion；explain 解释；expose 暴露；explore 探索。 【步骤】① express his opinion。② A. expressed ✓。③ B. explained——explain 一般 explain sth. to sb.，不与 opinion 直接搭，错。④ C. exposed——暴露，错。⑤ D. explored——探索，错。 【答案】A. expressed。 【易错】express/explain。 【口诀/模板句】express one's opinion 表观点，explain 解释给谁听；expose 暴露 explore 探，express opinion 最常用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】express opinion表达观点，expressed","【语法点/词汇】express one's opinion；explain 解释；expose 暴露；explore 探索。","【步骤】① express his opinion。② A. expressed ✓。③ B. explained——explain 一般 explain sth. to sb.，不与 opinion 直接搭，错。④ C. exposed——暴露，错。⑤ D. explored——探索，错。","【口诀/模板句】express one's opinion 表观点，explain 解释给谁听；expose 暴露 explore 探，express opinion 最常用。","【答案】expressed"],"pitfalls":["选 explained（explain 意为「解释」，与 opinion 搭配不当）","选 exposed（意为「暴露」）","选 explored（意为「探索」）","不知道 express one's opinion 是「表达观点」的固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】expressed 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为expressed。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne268","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the form before you leave.","options":["fill out","fill in","fill up","fill with"],"answer":"fill out","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ the form before you leave. 填表。 【语法点/词汇】fill out 填完整表；fill in 填空。 【步骤】① fill out the form（填表）。② A. fill out ✓。③ B. fill in——也可，但本题④ C. fill up——装满，错。⑤ D. fill with——充满，错。 【答案】A. fill out。 【易错】fill in/out。 【口诀/模板句】fill out 填整表，fill in 填空好；the form 前 fill out，填表离开 out 稳。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】fill out填写表格，固定","【语法点/词汇】fill out 填完整表；fill in 填空。","【步骤】① fill out the form（填表）。② A. fill out ✓。③ B. fill in——也可，但本题答案 out（强调填整张表）。④ C. fill up——装满，错。⑤ D. fill with——充满，错。","【口诀/模板句】fill out 填整表，fill in 填空好；the form 前 fill out，填表离开 out 稳。","【答案】fill out"],"pitfalls":["选 fill in（fill in 侧重点填写某一项，本题宾语是完整 form）","选 fill up（意为「装满」）","选 fill with（意为「用…装满」，结构不符）","不知道 fill out the form（填写整张表格）是常用搭配"],"hint":"【结论】fill out 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为fill out。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne269","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The ____ of the new law is to protect consumers.","options":["purpose","aim","goal","target"],"answer":"purpose","analysis":"【审题】题干：The ______ of the new law is to protect consumers. 法律的“目的”。 【语法点/词汇】purpose 目的（the purpose of）；aim/goal/target 也可表目标，但 the purpose of 是固定。 【步骤】① the purpose of the law。② A. purpose ✓。③ B. aim——the aim of 也可，但 purpose 更正式常见，本题④ C. goal——错。⑤ D. target——目标/靶子，错。 【答案】A. purpose。 【易错】purpose/aim/goal。 【口诀/模板句】the purpose of 是目的，law purpose to protect；aim goal target 目标，purpose of law 最常用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】purpose目的，法律的目的","【语法点/词汇】purpose 目的（the purpose of）；aim/goal/target 也可表目标，但 the purpose of 是固定。","【步骤】① the purpose of the law。② A. purpose ✓。③ B. aim——the aim of 也可，但 purpose 更正式常见，本题答案 purpose。④ C. goal——错。⑤ D. target——目标/靶子，错。","【口诀/模板句】the purpose of 是目的，law purpose to protect；aim goal target 目标，purpose of law 最常用。","【答案】purpose"],"pitfalls":["选 aim（aim 多指个人目标，此处指法律的「目的」）","选 goal（goal 多指具体目标）","选 target（target 指靶子或指标）","不知道 the purpose of sth 意为「某事物的目的」，最贴合法律条文语境"],"hint":"【结论】purpose 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为purpose。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne270","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ____ a good example to us.","options":["set","made","did","took"],"answer":"set","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ______ a good example to us. set an example（树立榜样）。 【语法点/词汇】set an example to sb.。 【步骤】① set a good example。② A. set ✓。③ B. made——错。④ C. did——错。⑤ D. took——错。 【答案】A. set。 【易错】make an example。 【口诀/模板句】set an example 树榜样，set a good example；make do take 不搭 example，set example 记心上。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】set an example树立榜样，set","【语法点/词汇】set an example to sb.。","【步骤】① set a good example。② A. set ✓。③ B. made——错。④ C. did——错。⑤ D. took——错。","【口诀/模板句】set an example 树榜样，set a good example；make do take 不搭 example，set example 记心上。","【答案】set"],"pitfalls":["选 made（make an example 意为「惩一儆百」，语义不同）","选 did（do an example 不成立）","选 took（take an example 不是标准搭配）","不知道 set a good example to sb（给某人树立好榜样）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】set 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为set。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne271","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I can't ____ why he did it.","options":["figure out","find out","look out","give out"],"answer":"figure out","analysis":"【审题】题干：I can't ______ why he did it. “弄明白”原因。 【语法点/词汇】figure out 弄明白；find out 查明；look out 小心；give out 分发。 【步骤】① figure out why。② A. figure out ✓。③ B. find out——也可查明，但 figure out 更强调“想明白”，本题④ C. look out——小心，错。⑤ D. give out——分发，错。 【答案】A. figure out。 【易错】figure out/find out。 【口诀/模板句】figure out 弄明白，find out 查清楚；look out 小心 give out 发，figure out why 选 A。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】figure out弄明白","【语法点/词汇】figure out 弄明白；find out 查明；look out 小心；give out 分发。","【步骤】① figure out why。② A. figure out ✓。③ B. find out——也可查明，但 figure out 更强调“想明白”，本题答案 figure out。④ C. look out——小心，错。⑤ D. give out——分发，错。","【口诀/模板句】figure out 弄明白，find out 查清楚；look out 小心 give out 发，figure out why 选 A。","【答案】figure out"],"pitfalls":["选 find out（意为「查明事实」）","选 look out（意为「小心」）","选 give out（意为「分发/耗尽」）","不知道 figure out 意为「弄明白（原因）」，与 why 从句搭配"],"hint":"【结论】figure out 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为figure out。"});
