  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne11","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"连词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"____ he is young, he knows a lot.","options":["Because","Although","If","When"],"answer":"Although","analysis":"【审题】题干：______ he is young, he knows a lot. 让步“虽然年轻却懂很多”。 【语法点/词汇】Although/Though 虽然。 【步骤】① 让步。② A. Because——因果，错。③ B. Although ✓。④ C. If——条件，错。⑤ D. When——时间，错。 【答案】B. Although。 【易错】Because 选。 【口诀/模板句】Although 让步虽然，年轻却懂很多；Because 用因果 If 条件，Although 让步最贴切。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["连词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】虽然年轻，Although","【语法点/词汇】Although/Though 虽然。","【步骤】① 让步。② A. Because——因果，错。③ B. Although ✓。④ C. If——条件，错。⑤ D. When——时间，错。","【口诀/模板句】Although 让步虽然，年轻却懂很多；Because 用因果 If 条件，Although 让步最贴切。","【答案】Although"],"pitfalls":["选 Because（语义相反：年轻与懂很多是转折）","选 If（表条件，与让步关系不符）","选 When（表时间，不表让步）","看不出前后是「虽然…但是」的让步关系"],"hint":"【结论】Although 【考点】连词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：连词。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为Although。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne17","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"We ____ each other sin2020.","options":["know","knew","have known","will know"],"answer":"have known","analysis":"【审题】题干：We ______ each other sin2020. sin现在完成时。 【语法点/词汇】have known（know→knew→known）。 【步骤】① sin2020 → 现在完成。② A. know——现在，错。③ B. knew——过去，错。④ C. have known ✓。⑤ D. will know——将来，错。 【答案】C. have known。 【易错】sin用过去。 【口诀/模板句】sin2020 用完成，have known 从过去至今；know knew known 三级，完成时 have known。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】since完成，have known","【语法点/词汇】have known（know→knew→known）。","【步骤】① since 2020 → 现在完成。② A. know——现在，错。③ B. knew——过去，错。④ C. have known ✓。⑤ D. will know——将来，错。","【口诀/模板句】since 2020 用完成，have known 从过去至今；know knew known 三级，完成时 have known。","【答案】have known"],"pitfalls":["选 know（一般现在时无法与 since 2020 表持续至今搭配）","选 knew（过去时不能表达延续到现在）","选 will know（将来时与 since 冲突）","题干 OCR 粘连（sin2020 应为 since 2020），看不出是现在完成时的标志"],"hint":"【结论】have known 【考点】时态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：时态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为have known。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne18","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"By next year, I ____ here for 3 years.","options":["will work","will have worked","work","worked"],"answer":"will have worked","analysis":"【审题】题干：By next year, I ______ here for 3 years. by next year 将来完成时。 【语法点/词汇】will have done（将来完成）。 【步骤】① by next year → 将来完成。② A. will work——将来，错。③ B. will have worked ✓。④ C. work——现在，错。⑤ D. worked——过去，错。 【答案】B. will have worked。 【易错】by + 将来时间用将来完成。 【口诀/模板句】by next year 将完成，will have worked；by + 将来时间，will have done 用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】By+明年将来完成，will have worked","【语法点/词汇】will have done（将来完成）。","【步骤】① by next year → 将来完成。② A. will work——将来，错。③ B. will have worked ✓。④ C. work——现在，错。⑤ D. worked——过去，错。","【口诀/模板句】by next year 将完成，will have worked；by + 将来时间，will have done 用。","【答案】will have worked"],"pitfalls":["选 will work（By next year 强调到那时已完成，需将来完成时）","选 work（一般现在时不合）","选 worked（过去时与 next year 冲突）","不知道 by + 将来时间 是将来完成时的典型标志"],"hint":"【结论】will have worked 【考点】时态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：时态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为will have worked。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne20","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"语态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"English ____ in many countries.","options":["speaks","is spoken","spoke","speaking"],"answer":"is spoken","analysis":"【审题】题干：English ______ in many countries. 英语被说，被动。 【语法点/词汇】is spoken（be + 过去分词）。 【步骤】① English 被说 → is spoken。② A. speaks——主动，错。③ B. is spoken ✓。④ C. spoke——过去，错。⑤ D. speaking——非谓语，错。 【答案】B. is spoken。 【易错】主动被动。 【口诀/模板句】English is spoken 被说，in many countries 范围；被动语态 be done，is spoken 记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["语态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】英语被说，is spoken","【语法点/词汇】is spoken（be + 过去分词）。","【步骤】① English 被说 → is spoken。② A. speaks——主动，错。③ B. is spoken ✓。④ C. spoke——过去，错。⑤ D. speaking——非谓语，错。","【口诀/模板句】English is spoken 被说，in many countries 范围；被动语态 be done，is spoken 记住。","【答案】is spoken"],"pitfalls":["选 speaks（主动，但 English 是被说的语言）","选 spoke（过去主动，语态时态都不对）","选 speaking（非谓语形式不能作谓语）","看不出 English 与 speak 是被动关系"],"hint":"【结论】is spoken 【考点】语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：语态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为is spoken。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne21","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The man ____ is talking to Mary is my teacher.","options":["which","who","whom","whose"],"answer":"who","analysis":"【审题】题干：The man ______ is talking to Mary is my teacher. 定语从句，先行词 man（人），从句缺主语。 【语法点/词汇】who 指人主语。 【步骤】① man 人。② 从句缺主语。③ A. which——物，错。④ B. who ✓。⑤ C. whom——宾格，错。⑥ D. whose——所有格，错。 【答案】B. who。 【易错】who/whom。 【口诀/模板句】the man who is talking，人主 who 最常用；which 物 whom 宾 whose 所有，who 主语最不空。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】man人作主语，who","【语法点/词汇】who 指人主语。","【步骤】① man 人。② 从句缺主语。③ A. which——物，错。④ B. who ✓。⑤ C. whom——宾格，错。⑥ D. whose——所有格，错。","【口诀/模板句】the man who is talking，人主 who 最常用；which 物 whom 宾 whose 所有，who 主语最不空。","【答案】who"],"pitfalls":["选 which（先行词 The man 是人）","选 whom（从句缺主语，whom 只作宾语）","选 whose（表所属，本题从句缺主语）","看不出从句 is talking 缺主语，需关系代词 who"],"hint":"【结论】who 【考点】定语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：定语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为who。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne22","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"This is the house ____ I lived last year.","options":["which","that","where","when"],"answer":"where","analysis":"【审题】题干：This is the house ______ I lived last year. lived 不及物，缺地点状语。 【语法点/词汇】where = in which。 【步骤】① house 地点。② I lived 缺地点。③ A. which——错。④ B. that——错。⑤ C. where ✓。⑥ D. when——时间，错。 【答案】C. where。 【易错】which/where。 【口诀/模板句】the house where I lived，地点 where 时间 when；I lived in the house，where 作状语。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】house地点，where","【语法点/词汇】where = in which。","【步骤】① house 地点。② I lived 缺地点。③ A. which——错。④ B. that——错。⑤ C. where ✓。⑥ D. when——时间，错。","【口诀/模板句】the house where I lived，地点 where 时间 when；I lived in the house，where 作状语。","【答案】where"],"pitfalls":["选 which（从句缺地点状语，which 不能作状语）","选 that（不能跟在 the house 后表地点）","选 when（表时间，与 house 不符）","不知道先行词是地点且从句缺状语时用关系副词 where"],"hint":"【结论】where 【考点】定语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：定语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为where。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne23","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will never forget the day ____ we met.","options":["which","that","when","where"],"answer":"when","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will never forget the day ______ we met. the day 时间，缺时间状语。 【语法点/词汇】when = on which。 【步骤】① the day 时间。② we met 缺时间。③ A. which——错。④ B. that——错。⑤ C. when ✓。⑥ D. where——地点，错。 【答案】C. when。 【易错】when/where。 【口诀/模板句】the day when we met，时间 when 地点 where；forget the day when，时间状语 when 配。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】day时间，when","【语法点/词汇】when = on which。","【步骤】① the day 时间。② we met 缺时间。③ A. which——错。④ B. that——错。⑤ C. when ✓。⑥ D. where——地点，错。","【口诀/模板句】the day when we met，时间 when 地点 where；forget the day when，时间状语 when 配。","【答案】when"],"pitfalls":["选 which（从句缺时间状语，which 不能作状语）","选 that（同上，不能作时间状语）","选 where（表地点，与 the day 不符）","不知道先行词是时间且从句缺状语时用关系副词 when"],"hint":"【结论】when 【考点】定语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：定语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为when。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne25","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"宾语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I don't know ____ he is right.","options":["that","if","what","which"],"answer":"if","analysis":"【审题】题干：I don't know ______ he is right. “是否”对。 【语法点/词汇】if/whether 是否。 【步骤】① 不确定“是否”。② A. that——陈述，错。③ B. if ✓。④ C. what——错。⑤ D. which——错。 【答案】B. if。 【易错】that 选。 【口诀/模板句】don't know if 是否，if/whether 表是否；I don't know if he is right，是否对错 if 配。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["宾语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】是否，if","【语法点/词汇】if/whether 是否。","【步骤】① 不确定“是否”。② A. that——陈述，错。③ B. if ✓。④ C. what——错。⑤ D. which——错。","【口诀/模板句】don't know if 是否，if/whether 表是否；I don't know if he is right，是否对错 if 配。","【答案】if"],"pitfalls":["选 that（that 不能引导表「是否」的宾语从句）","选 what（从句成分完整，what 需作成分）","选 which（表「哪一个」，语义不合）","不知道 know 后表「是否」可用 if / whether"],"hint":"【结论】if 【考点】宾语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：宾语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为if。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne26","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I enjoy ____ books.","options":["read","reading","to read","reads"],"answer":"reading","analysis":"【审题】题干：I enjoy ______ books. enjoy doing。 【语法点/词汇】enjoy reading。 【步骤】① enjoy doing。② A. read——错。③ B. reading ✓。④ C. to read——错。⑤ D. reads——错。 【答案】B. reading。 【易错】enjoy to read。 【口诀/模板句】enjoy reading 读书乐，enjoy doing 是固定；to read 不接 enjoy，reading books 最正确。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】enjoy doing，reading","【语法点/词汇】enjoy reading。","【步骤】① enjoy doing。② A. read——错。③ B. reading ✓。④ C. to read——错。⑤ D. reads——错。","【口诀/模板句】enjoy reading 读书乐，enjoy doing 是固定；to read 不接 enjoy，reading books 最正确。","【答案】reading"],"pitfalls":["选 read（enjoy 后不接动词原形）","选 to read（enjoy 后接动名词，不接不定式）","选 reads（第三人称单数形式不合）","不知道 enjoy doing sth 是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】reading 【考点】非谓语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：非谓语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为reading。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne27","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He decided ____ abroad.","options":["go","going","to go","went"],"answer":"to go","analysis":"【审题】题干：He decided ______ abroad. decide to do。 【语法点/词汇】decide to do。 【步骤】① decide to go。② A. go——缺 to，错。③ B. going——错。④ C. to go ✓。⑤ D. went——错。 【答案】C. to go。 【易错】decide doing。 【口诀/模板句】decide to do 决定做，to go abroad 出国去；decide 后 to do，going went 不对。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】decide to do，to go","【语法点/词汇】decide to do。","【步骤】① decide to go。② A. go——缺 to，错。③ B. going——错。④ C. to go ✓。⑤ D. went——错。","【口诀/模板句】decide to do 决定做，to go abroad 出国去；decide 后 to do，going went 不对。","【答案】to go"],"pitfalls":["选 go（decide 后要接不定式）","选 going（decide doing 不是标准搭配）","选 went（过去式不能作 decide 的宾语）","不知道 decide to do sth 是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】to go 【考点】非谓语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：非谓语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为to go。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne28","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book is worth ____.","options":["read","reading","to read","being read"],"answer":"reading","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book is worth ______. be worth doing（值得做）。 【语法点/词汇】be worth doing。 【步骤】① worth reading。② A. read——错。③ B. reading ✓。④ C. to read——错。⑤ D. being read——错。 【答案】B. reading。 【易错】worth to do。 【口诀/模板句】be worth doing 值得做，worth reading 值得读；to read 不配 worth，reading 主动表被动。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be worth doing，reading","【语法点/词汇】be worth doing。","【步骤】① worth reading。② A. read——错。③ B. reading ✓。④ C. to read——错。⑤ D. being read——错。","【口诀/模板句】be worth doing 值得做，worth reading 值得读；to read 不配 worth，reading 主动表被动。","【答案】reading"],"pitfalls":["选 read（be worth 后不接原形）","选 to read（worth 后不接不定式）","选 being read（语态与语义都不合，书值得读是主动意义）","不知道 be worth doing 是固定结构，且用主动形式表被动意义"],"hint":"【结论】reading 【考点】非谓语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：非谓语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为reading。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne31","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"You ____ finish the work today; it's not urgent.","options":["must","needn't","can't","may"],"answer":"needn't","analysis":"【审题】题干：You ______ finish the work today; it's not urgent. 不紧急，不必今天完成。 【语法点/词汇】needn't 不必。 【步骤】① not urgent → 不必。② A. must——必须，反，错。③ B. needn't ✓。④ C. can't——不能，错。⑤ D. may——可能，错。 【答案】B. needn't。 【易错】mustn't 禁止 vs needn't 不必。 【口诀/模板句】needn't 不必 mustn't 禁，not urgent 用 needn't；不必今天 finish，needn't 最对。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】不急不必，needn't","【语法点/词汇】needn't 不必。","【步骤】① not urgent → 不必。② A. must——必须，反，错。③ B. needn't ✓。④ C. can't——不能，错。⑤ D. may——可能，错。","【口诀/模板句】needn't 不必 mustn't 禁，not urgent 用 needn't；不必今天 finish，needn't 最对。","【答案】needn't"],"pitfalls":["选 must（must 表必须，与 it's not urgent 相反）","选 can't（表禁止/不可能）","选 may（表许可，与「不必」的语气不符）","读不出 it's not urgent 提示「没必要」，应用 needn't"],"hint":"【结论】needn't 【考点】情态动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：情态动词。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为needn't。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne32","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"情态动词","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The light is on. They ____ be at home.","options":["must","can","need","would"],"answer":"must","analysis":"【审题】题干：The light is on. They ______ be at home. 灯亮着，有证据“一定”在家。 【语法点/词汇】must 表有把握推测。 【步骤】① 灯亮证据 → must。② A. must ✓。③ B. can——可能，弱，错。④ C. need——实义动词/需要，错。⑤ D. would——过去将来，错。 【答案】A. must。 【易错】must 推测 vs can't 不可能。 【口诀/模板句】must 推测有证据，light is on 必在家；can 可能 need 需要，must be at home。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["情态动词","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】肯定推测，must","【语法点/词汇】must 表有把握推测。","【步骤】① 灯亮证据 → must。② A. must ✓。③ B. can——可能，弱，错。④ C. need——实义动词/需要，错。⑤ D. would——过去将来，错。","【口诀/模板句】must 推测有证据，light is on 必在家；can 可能 need 需要，must be at home。","【答案】must"],"pitfalls":["选 can（表能力，不表推测）","选 need（need 表需要，不表推测）","选 would（表意愿或虚拟，不表肯定推测）","不知道 must be 表示「一定在」的强烈推测（灯亮着 → 一定在家）"],"hint":"【结论】must 【考点】情态动词 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：情态动词。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为must。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne36","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The ____ of the new city is very fast.","options":["develop","development","developing","developed"],"answer":"development","analysis":"【审题】题干：The ______ of the new city is very fast. the 后名词。 【语法点/词汇】development 名词；develop 动词；developing 发展中的；developed 发达的。 【步骤】① the ______ of，名词。② A. develop——动词，错。③ B. development ✓。④ C. developing——形容词，错。⑤ D. developed——形容词，错。 【答案】B. development。 【易错】词形。 【口诀/模板句】development 名词发展，the development of city；develop 动词 developing 形，the 后名词最稳。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】名词development，发展","【语法点/词汇】development 名词；develop 动词；developing 发展中的；developed 发达的。","【步骤】① the ______ of，名词。② A. develop——动词，错。③ B. development ✓。④ C. developing——形容词，错。⑤ D. developed——形容词，错。","【口诀/模板句】development 名词发展，the development of city；develop 动词 developing 形，the 后名词最稳。","【答案】development"],"pitfalls":["选 develop（动词不能作主语）","选 developing（现在分词/形容词，不能作主语）","选 developed（形容词/过去分词，不能作主语）","不知道 The + 名词 + of 结构中空格要填名词 development"],"hint":"【结论】development 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为development。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne37","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He made a careful ____ of the situation.","options":["analysis","analyze","analytical","analyst"],"answer":"analysis","analysis":"【审题】题干：He made a careful ______ of the situation. a + 形容词 + 名词。 【语法点/词汇】analysis 名词；analyze 动词；analytical 形容词；analyst 分析师。 【步骤】① a careful ______ of，名词。② A. analysis ✓。③ B. analyze——动词，错。④ C. analytical——形容词，错。⑤ D. analyst——人，错。 【答案】A. analysis。 【易错】analyze/analysis。 【口诀/模板句】analysis 名词分析，make an analysis of；analyze 动词 analyst 人，a careful analysis。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】名词analysis，分析","【语法点/词汇】analysis 名词；analyze 动词；analytical 形容词；analyst 分析师。","【步骤】① a careful ______ of，名词。② A. analysis ✓。③ B. analyze——动词，错。④ C. analytical——形容词，错。⑤ D. analyst——人，错。","【口诀/模板句】analysis 名词分析，make an analysis of；analyze 动词 analyst 人，a careful analysis。","【答案】analysis"],"pitfalls":["选 analyze（动词，不能跟在 a careful 后作名词）","选 analytical（形容词，不能作 made 的宾语）","选 analyst（名词但指「分析师」这个人，不合语义）","不知道 make an analysis of 意为「对…进行分析」"],"hint":"【结论】analysis 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为analysis。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne38","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I am looking forward ____ you soon.","options":["to see","to seeing","see","seeing"],"answer":"to seeing","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am looking forward ______ you soon. look forward to doing。 【语法点/词汇】to seeing。 【步骤】① look forward to doing。② A. to see——错。③ B. to seeing ✓。④ C. see——错。⑤ D. seeing——缺 to，错。 【答案】B. to seeing。 【易错】look forward to see。 【口诀/模板句】look forward to seeing，to 介词动名词；to seeing you soon，介词 to 后 ing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】look forward to doing，to seeing","【语法点/词汇】to seeing。","【步骤】① look forward to doing。② A. to see——错。③ B. to seeing ✓。④ C. see——错。⑤ D. seeing——缺 to，错。","【口诀/模板句】look forward to seeing，to 介词动名词；to seeing you soon，介词 to 后 ing。","【答案】to seeing"],"pitfalls":["选 to see（look forward to 中 to 是介词，后接动名词）","选 see（介词后不能接原形）","选 seeing（缺介词 to，结构不完整）","把 look forward to 里的 to 误当成不定式符号"],"hint":"【结论】to seeing 【考点】固定搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：固定搭配。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为to seeing。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne39","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is used to ____ early.","options":["get up","getting up","got up","gets up"],"answer":"getting up","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is used to ______ early. be used to doing（习惯于）。 【语法点/词汇】be used to doing 习惯；used to do 过去常常。 【步骤】① 习惯早起 → getting up。② A. get up——错。③ B. getting up ✓。④ C. got up——错。⑤ D. gets up——错。 【答案】B. getting up。 【易错】be used to doing / used to do。 【口诀/模板句】be used to doing 习惯于，used to do 过去常；is used to getting up，to 是介词 ing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】be used to doing，getting up","【语法点/词汇】be used to doing 习惯；used to do 过去常常。","【步骤】① 习惯早起 → getting up。② A. get up——错。③ B. getting up ✓。④ C. got up——错。⑤ D. gets up——错。","【口诀/模板句】be used to doing 习惯于，used to do 过去常；is used to getting up，to 是介词 ing。","【答案】getting up"],"pitfalls":["选 get up（介词 to 后不能接原形）","选 got up（过去式不能作介词宾语）","选 gets up（第三人称单数形式不合）","不知道 be used to doing（习惯于）与 used to do（过去常常）的区别"],"hint":"【结论】getting up 【考点】固定搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：固定搭配。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为getting up。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne40","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The meeting ____ until midnight.","options":["lasted","kept","spent","took"],"answer":"lasted","analysis":"【审题】题干：The meeting ______ until midnight. 会议“持续”到半夜。 【语法点/词汇】last 持续。 【步骤】① 持续 → lasted。② A. lasted ✓。③ B. kept——keep 应 keep doing/adj，错。④ C. spent——人 spend，错。⑤ D. took——It took，错。 【答案】A. lasted。 【易错】last/keep。 【口诀/模板句】last 持续 until 中，the meeting lasted until；keep spent took 不对，lasted midnight。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】会议持续，lasted","【语法点/词汇】last 持续。","【步骤】① 持续 → lasted。② A. lasted ✓。③ B. kept——keep 应 keep doing/adj，错。④ C. spent——人 spend，错。⑤ D. took——It took，错。","【口诀/模板句】last 持续 until 中，the meeting lasted until；keep spent took 不对，lasted midnight。","【答案】lasted"],"pitfalls":["选 kept（keep 不表「持续到某时间」）","选 spent（spend 的主语必须是人）","选 took（take 不用于会议持续）","不知道 last 作动词意为「持续」，与 until 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】lasted 【考点】固定搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：固定搭配。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为lasted。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne41","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"It is ____ that he will succeed.","options":["likely","possible probably","maybe","perhaps"],"answer":"likely","analysis":"【审题】题干：It is ______ that he will succeed. It is likely that（很可能）。 【语法点/词汇】likely 形容词，It is likely that；possible 常 It is possible for sb. to do；probably 副词；maybe/perhaps 副词。 【步骤】① It is likely that 句型。② A. likely ✓。③ B. possible probably——两个词混，错。④ C. maybe——副词，错。⑤ D. perhaps——副词，错。 【答案】A. likely。 【易错】likely/possible。 【口诀/模板句】It is likely that 有可能，likely 形容词；possible for sb. to do，probably 副词置句中。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】likely可能，It is likely","【语法点/词汇】likely 形容词，It is likely that；possible 常 It is possible for sb. to do；probably 副词；maybe/perhaps 副词。","【步骤】① It is likely that 句型。② A. likely ✓。③ B. possible probably——两个词混，错。④ C. maybe——副词，错。⑤ D. perhaps——副词，错。","【口诀/模板句】It is likely that 有可能，likely 形容词；possible for sb. to do，probably 副词置句中。","【答案】likely"],"pitfalls":["选 possible probably（词性叠用，语法错误）","选 maybe（副词不能作 It is 后的表语）","选 perhaps（副词，不能填在 It is ... that 结构里）","不知道 It is likely that 是「很可能…」的固定句型"],"hint":"【结论】likely 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为likely。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne42","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the differenbetween the two words.","options":["say","speak","tell","talk"],"answer":"tell","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ the differenbetween the two words. tell the difference（说出区别）。 【语法点/词汇】tell the difference；say/speak/talk 不与 differen直接搭。 【步骤】① tell the difference。② A. say——say sth.，错。③ B. speak——speak English，错。④ C. tell ✓。⑤ D. talk——talk with/to，错。 【答案】C. tell。 【易错】say/tell。 【口诀/模板句】tell the differen说区别，tell sb. sth. 告诉；say 内容 speak 语 talk 谈，tell differen最固定。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】tell the difference辨别，tell","【语法点/词汇】tell the difference；say/speak/talk 不与 difference 直接搭。","【步骤】① tell the difference。② A. say——say sth.，错。③ B. speak——speak English，错。④ C. tell ✓。⑤ D. talk——talk with/to，错。","【口诀/模板句】tell the difference 说区别，tell sb. sth. 告诉；say 内容 speak 语 talk 谈，tell difference 最固定。","【答案】tell"],"pitfalls":["选 say（say 后不能直接接「区别」这类抽象宾语）","选 speak（speak 不接 the difference）","选 talk（talk 需接 about）","题干 OCR 粘连（differenbetween 应为 difference between），不知道 tell the difference 是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】tell 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为tell。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne45","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词性转换","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She spoke ____ at the meeting.","options":["confidence","confident","confidently","confiding"],"answer":"confidently","analysis":"【审题】题干：She spoke ______ at the meeting. 修饰动词 spoke 用副词。 【语法点/词汇】confidently 副词；confiden名词；confident 形容词。 【步骤】① 修饰 spoke 用副词。② A. confidence——名词，错。③ B. confident——形容词，错。④ C. confidently ✓。⑤ D. confiding——现在分词，错。 【答案】C. confidently。 【易错】词性。 【口诀/模板句】spoke confidently 自信说，副词修动词；confident 形 confiden名，词性要分清。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词性转换","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】副词confidently修饰spoke","【语法点/词汇】confidently 副词；confidence 名词；confident 形容词。","【步骤】① 修饰 spoke 用副词。② A. confidence——名词，错。③ B. confident——形容词，错。④ C. confidently ✓。⑤ D. confiding——现在分词，错。","【口诀/模板句】spoke confidently 自信说，副词修动词；confident 形 confidence 名，词性要分清。","【答案】confidently"],"pitfalls":["选 confidence（名词，不能修饰动词 spoke）","选 confident（形容词，不能修饰动词）","选 confiding（动词分词，词义不符）","不知道修饰动词要用副词 confidently"],"hint":"【结论】confidently 【考点】词性转换 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词性转换。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为confidently。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne48","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The plane ____ at 8 a.m. yesterday.","options":["took off","took up","took out","took over"],"answer":"took off","analysis":"【审题】题干：The plane ______ at 8 a.m. yesterday. 飞机起飞。 【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞。 【步骤】① plane 起飞 → took off。② A. took off ✓。③ B. took up——占据，错。④ C. took out——取出，错。⑤ D. took over——接管，错。 【答案】A. took off。 【易错】take 短语。 【口诀/模板句】plane took off 起飞，at 8 a.m. yesterday；take off 起飞脱衣，took off 过去式。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】昨天飞机起飞，took off","【语法点/词汇】take off 起飞。","【步骤】① plane 起飞 → took off。② A. took off ✓。③ B. took up——占据，错。④ C. took out——取出，错。⑤ D. took over——接管，错。","【口诀/模板句】plane took off 起飞，at 8 a.m. yesterday；take off 起飞脱衣，took off 过去式。","【答案】took off"],"pitfalls":["选 took up（占据/开始从事）","选 took out（取出）","选 took over（接管）","不知道 take off 有「起飞」的含义，与 plane 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】took off 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为took off。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne49","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will ____ the company while he is away.","options":["take over","take up","take in","take out"],"answer":"take over","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will ______ the company while he is away. 他离开，我“接管”公司。 【语法点/词汇】take over 接管；take up 占据；take in 吸收；take out 取出。 【步骤】① 接管公司 → take over。② A. take over ✓。③ B. take up——错。④ C. take in——错。⑤ D. take out——错。 【答案】A. take over。 【易错】take 短语。 【口诀/模板句】take over 接管权，while he is away；take over the company，接替主管 take over。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】他不在接管，take over","【语法点/词汇】take over 接管；take up 占据；take in 吸收；take out 取出。","【步骤】① 接管公司 → take over。② A. take over ✓。③ B. take up——错。④ C. take in——错。⑤ D. take out——错。","【口诀/模板句】take over 接管权，while he is away；take over the company，接替主管 take over。","【答案】take over"],"pitfalls":["选 take up（占据/开始从事）","选 take in（吸收/欺骗）","选 take out（取出）","不知道 take over 意为「接管」，与 company 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】take over 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为take over。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne50","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a new hobby last year.","options":["took up","took off","took out","took to"],"answer":"took up","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ a new hobby last year. “开始从事”新爱好。 【语法点/词汇】take up 开始从事/占据；take off 起飞；take out 取出；take to 喜欢。 【步骤】① 开始爱好 → took up。② A. took up ✓。③ B. took off——错。④ C. took out——错。⑤ D. took to——to 后应接 sth./doing，且语义“喜欢”，错。 【答案】A. took up。 【易错】take up/to。 【口诀/模板句】take up 开始学爱好，take up a hobby；took up last year，过去式加 up。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】开始爱好，took up","【语法点/词汇】take up 开始从事/占据；take off 起飞；take out 取出；take to 喜欢。","【步骤】① 开始爱好 → took up。② A. took up ✓。③ B. took off——错。④ C. took out——错。⑤ D. took to——to 后应接 sth./doing，且语义“喜欢”，错。","【口诀/模板句】take up 开始学爱好，take up a hobby；took up last year，过去式加 up。","【答案】took up"],"pitfalls":["选 took off（起飞/脱下）","选 took out（取出）","选 took to（喜欢上，后接动名词或人）","不知道 take up 有「开始从事（爱好）」的含义"],"hint":"【结论】took up 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为took up。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne53","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She is afraid ____ snakes.","options":["of","for","with","at"],"answer":"of","analysis":"【审题】题干：She is afraid ______ snakes. be afraid of。 【语法点/词汇】afraid of。 【步骤】① afraid of snakes。② A. of ✓。③ B. for——错。④ C. with——错。⑤ D. at——错。 【答案】A. of。 【易错】afraid for（为……担心）。 【口诀/模板句】afraid of 害怕物，afraid for 为人忧；afraid of snakes 蛇，of 是固定。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】afraid of，of","【语法点/词汇】afraid of。","【步骤】① afraid of snakes。② A. of ✓。③ B. for——错。④ C. with——错。⑤ D. at——错。","【口诀/模板句】afraid of 害怕物，afraid for 为人忧；afraid of snakes 蛇，of 是固定。","【答案】of"],"pitfalls":["选 for（be afraid for 意为「为…担心」，不接具体恐惧对象）","选 with（不搭配）","选 at（不搭配）","不知道 be afraid of sth 是「害怕某物」的固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】of 【考点】固定搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：固定搭配。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为of。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne54","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book is divided ____ 10 units.","options":["into","in","to","for"],"answer":"into","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book is divided ______ 10 units. be divided into（被分成）。 【语法点/词汇】divide…into。 【步骤】① divided into 10 units。② A. into ✓。③ B. in——错。④ C. to——错。⑤ D. for——错。 【答案】A. into。 【易错】divide into/in。 【口诀/模板句】divide into 分成份，be divided into 10 units；divide into 固定，into 不改成 in。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】divide into，into","【语法点/词汇】divide…into。","【步骤】① divided into 10 units。② A. into ✓。③ B. in——错。④ C. to——错。⑤ D. for——错。","【口诀/模板句】divide into 分成份，be divided into 10 units；divide into 固定，into 不改成 in。","【答案】into"],"pitfalls":["选 in（be divided in 不是标准搭配）","选 to（divide to 不成立）","选 for（不搭配）","不知道 be divided into 意为「被分成」，是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】into 【考点】固定搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：固定搭配。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为into。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne55","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"固定搭配","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He succeeded ____ passing the exam.","options":["in","on","at","with"],"answer":"in","analysis":"【审题】题干：He succeeded ______ passing the exam. succeed in doing。 【语法点/词汇】succeed in doing。 【步骤】① succeeded in passing。② A. in ✓。③ B. on——错。④ C. at——错。⑤ D. with——错。 【答案】A. in。 【易错】succeed in/at。 【口诀/模板句】succeed in doing 成功做，succeeded in passing；介词 in 是固定，in passing exam。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["固定搭配","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】succeed in，in","【语法点/词汇】succeed in doing。","【步骤】① succeeded in passing。② A. in ✓。③ B. on——错。④ C. at——错。⑤ D. with——错。","【口诀/模板句】succeed in doing 成功做，succeeded in passing；介词 in 是固定，in passing exam。","【答案】in"],"pitfalls":["选 on（succeed on 不成立）","选 at（succeed at 不如 in 常用，且此处接动名词）","选 with（不搭配）","不知道 succeed in doing sth 是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】in 【考点】固定搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：固定搭配。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为in。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne57","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ my homework when he came in.","options":["do","did","was doing","have done"],"answer":"was doing","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ my homework when he came in. when 从句过去，主句过去进行。 【语法点/词汇】was doing。 【步骤】① came in 过去点。② 主句正在做作业 → was doing。③ A. do——错。④ B. did——错。⑤ C. was doing ✓。⑥ D. have done——错。 【答案】C. was doing。 【易错】when 主从句时态。 【口诀/模板句】when 过去式，主句 was doing；I was doing homework when he came in，进行背景过去点。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】came时正在做，was doing","【语法点/词汇】was doing。","【步骤】① came in 过去点。② 主句正在做作业 → was doing。③ A. do——错。④ B. did——错。⑤ C. was doing ✓。⑥ D. have done——错。","【口诀/模板句】when 过去式，主句 was doing；I was doing homework when he came in，进行背景过去点。","【答案】was doing"],"pitfalls":["选 do（缺 be 动词，无法构成过去进行时）","选 did（一般过去时不能表示「他进来时我正在做」）","选 have done（现在完成时不表过去的持续动作）","不知道 when he came in 是过去进行时的典型时间参照"],"hint":"【结论】was doing 【考点】时态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：时态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为was doing。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne58","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"时态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"By the time he arrived, the train ____.","options":["left","has left","had left","leaves"],"answer":"had left","analysis":"【审题】题干：By the time he arrived, the train ______. by the time + 过去，主句过去完成。 【语法点/词汇】had done（过去的过去）。 【步骤】① arrived 过去，火车离开更早 → had left。② A. left——同时，错。③ B. has left——现在完成，错。④ C. had left ✓。⑤ D. leaves——现在，错。 【答案】C. had left。 【易错】by the time 时态。 【口诀/模板句】by the time 过去式，主句 had done；had left 过去完成，火车先走 he arrived。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["时态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】arrived之前离开，had left","【语法点/词汇】had done（过去的过去）。","【步骤】① arrived 过去，火车离开更早 → had left。② A. left——同时，错。③ B. has left——现在完成，错。④ C. had left ✓。⑤ D. leaves——现在，错。","【口诀/模板句】by the time 过去式，主句 had done；had left 过去完成，火车先走 he arrived。","【答案】had left"],"pitfalls":["选 left（一般过去时不能表示「在他到达之前已经离开」）","选 has left（现在完成时与过去时间点 By the time he arrived 不符）","选 leaves（一般现在时完全不合）","不知道 by the time + 过去时从句，主句要用过去完成时（更早发生的动作用 had done）"],"hint":"【结论】had left 【考点】时态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：时态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为had left。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne59","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"语态","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The work ____ by the team now.","options":["is done","is being done","was done","has done"],"answer":"is being done","analysis":"【审题】题干：The work ______ by the team now. now 现在进行被动。 【语法点/词汇】is being done（现在进行被动）。 【步骤】① now → 进行。② by the team → 被动。③ A. is done——一般被动，错。④ B. is being done ✓。⑤ C. was done——过去，错。⑥ D. has done——主动，错。 【答案】B. is being done。 【易错】is done 与 is being done。 【口诀/模板句】now 进行被动式，is being done；工作正在被做 is being done，by the team 施动。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["语态","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】now正在被做，is being done","【语法点/词汇】is being done（现在进行被动）。","【步骤】① now → 进行。② by the team → 被动。③ A. is done——一般被动，错。④ B. is being done ✓。⑤ C. was done——过去，错。⑥ D. has done——主动，错。","【口诀/模板句】now 进行被动式，is being done；工作正在被做 is being done，by the team 施动。","【答案】is being done"],"pitfalls":["选 is done（一般现在时被动，不能表示「此刻正在被做」）","选 was done（过去时与 now 冲突）","选 has done（主动语态，语态错）","看不出 now 加被动语态需要「被动进行时」is being done"],"hint":"【结论】is being done 【考点】语态 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：语态。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为is being done。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne60","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"主谓一致","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Neither he nor I ____ a doctor.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":"am","analysis":"【审题】题干：Neither he nor I ______ a doctor. neither…nor 就近原则，靠近的是 I。 【语法点/词汇】就近原则：neither…nor…，be 与最近主语一致。 【步骤】① nor I → am。② A. am ✓。③ B. is——he 靠近时用，此处 I 靠近，错。④ C. are——错。⑤ D. be——原形，错。 【答案】A. am。 【易错】就近原则。 【口诀/模板句】neither nor 就近看，I am he is；Neither he nor I am，就近原则最常用。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["主谓一致","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】就近I，am","【语法点/词汇】就近原则：neither…nor…，be 与最近主语一致。","【步骤】① nor I → am。② A. am ✓。③ B. is——he 靠近时用，此处 I 靠近，错。④ C. are——错。⑤ D. be——原形，错。","【口诀/模板句】neither nor 就近看，I am he is；Neither he nor I am，就近原则最常用。","【答案】am"],"pitfalls":["选 is（neither...nor 遵循就近原则，靠近 I 应用 am）","选 are（neither...nor 不用复数谓语）","选 be（原形不能作谓语）","不知道 neither...nor 连接主语时谓语与最近的主语一致"],"hint":"【结论】am 【考点】主谓一致 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：主谓一致。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为am。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne61","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"主谓一致","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The teacher with students ____ coming.","options":["is","are","were","be"],"answer":"is","analysis":"【审题】题干：The teacher with students ______ coming. with 短语不是主语，主语是 teacher。 【语法点/词汇】就远原则：with/along with/as well as 不影响主语单复数。 【步骤】① 主语 teacher 单数。② A. is ✓。③ B. are——被 students 干扰，错。④ C. were——错。⑤ D. be——错。 【答案】A. is。 【易错】with 后名词当主语。 【口诀/模板句】with 学生不影响，主语 teacher 用 is；with along with 就远，主谓一致看主语。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["主谓一致","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】with就远，teacher单数is","【语法点/词汇】就远原则：with/along with/as well as 不影响主语单复数。","【步骤】① 主语 teacher 单数。② A. is ✓。③ B. are——被 students 干扰，错。④ C. were——错。⑤ D. be——错。","【口诀/模板句】with 学生不影响，主语 teacher 用 is；with along with 就远，主谓一致看主语。","【答案】is"],"pitfalls":["选 are（The teacher with students 的主语中心词是 teacher，单数）","选 were（时态与 is coming 的现在语境不符）","选 be（原形不能作谓语）","不知道 with 引导的短语是附加成分，谓语仍与前面的主语一致"],"hint":"【结论】is 【考点】主谓一致 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：主谓一致。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为is。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne62","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"定语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The book ____ cover is red is mine.","options":["which","that","whose","where"],"answer":"whose","analysis":"【审题】题干：The book ______ cover is red is mine. cover 是 book 的“封面”，所有格。 【语法点/词汇】whose = of which，表“谁的/什么的”。 【步骤】① the book's cover = whose cover。② A. which——错。③ B. that——错。④ C. whose ✓。⑤ D. where——错。 【答案】C. whose。 【易错】whose 只用于人。 【口诀/模板句】whose 表所有格，book whose cover red；whose 可代人也可物，the book's cover 就是 whose。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["定语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】whose cover谁的封面","【语法点/词汇】whose = of which，表“谁的/什么的”。","【步骤】① the book's cover = whose cover。② A. which——错。③ B. that——错。④ C. whose ✓。⑤ D. where——错。","【口诀/模板句】whose 表所有格，book whose cover red；whose 可代人也可物，the book's cover 就是 whose。","【答案】whose"],"pitfalls":["选 which（从句缺定语，which 不能直接修饰 cover）","选 that（同样不能表示「它的」所属关系）","选 where（表地点，与 cover 不符）","不知道先行词与从句名词之间是所属关系时要用 whose"],"hint":"【结论】whose 【考点】定语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：定语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为whose。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne64","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will call you ____ I arrive.","options":["as soon as","as long as","as well as","as far as"],"answer":"as soon as","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will call you ______ I arrive. “一……就……”。 【语法点/词汇】as soon as 一……就……；as long as 只要；as well as 也；as far as 就……而言。 【步骤】① 时间“一到就打电话”。② A. as soon as ✓。③ B. as long as——条件，错。④ C. as well as——并列，错。⑤ D. as far as——范围，错。 【答案】A. as soon as。 【易错】as 短语。 【口诀/模板句】as soon as 一……就，call you as soon as；as long as 只要 as well as 也，as soon as 时间。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】一到就，as soon as","【语法点/词汇】as soon as 一……就……；as long as 只要；as well as 也；as far as 就……而言。","【步骤】① 时间“一到就打电话”。② A. as soon as ✓。③ B. as long as——条件，错。④ C. as well as——并列，错。⑤ D. as far as——范围，错。","【口诀/模板句】as soon as 一……就，call you as soon as；as long as 只要 as well as 也，as soon as 时间。","【答案】as soon as"],"pitfalls":["选 as long as（表条件「只要」）","选 as well as（表并列「和」）","选 as far as（表范围「就…而言」）","读不出「我一到就打电话」是时间先后关系，应用 as soon as"],"hint":"【结论】as soon as 【考点】状语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：状语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为as soon as。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne65","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"____ it rains, we will stay at home.","options":["If","Unless","Though","Because"],"answer":"If","analysis":"【审题】题干：______ it rains, we will stay at home. 条件“如果”。 【语法点/词汇】If 条件。 【步骤】① 条件。② A. If ✓。③ B. Unless——除非，错。④ C. Though——虽然，错。⑤ D. Because——因为，错。 【答案】A. If。 【易错】Unless 混。 【口诀/模板句】If 条件如果，it rains 主将从现；Unless 除非 Though 虽，If 条件最常见。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】如果下雨，If","【语法点/词汇】If 条件。","【步骤】① 条件。② A. If ✓。③ B. Unless——除非，错。④ C. Though——虽然，错。⑤ D. Because——因为，错。","【口诀/模板句】If 条件如果，it rains 主将从现；Unless 除非 Though 虽，If 条件最常见。","【答案】If"],"pitfalls":["选 Unless（表「除非」，与句意相反）","选 Though（表让步）","选 Because（表原因）","看不出「下雨就待在家」是条件关系，且主将从现"],"hint":"【结论】If 【考点】状语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：状语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为If。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne66","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"状语从句","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He ran fast ____ he could catch the bus.","options":["so that","such that","in order to","as that"],"answer":"so that","analysis":"【审题】题干：He ran fast ______ he could catch the bus. 目的“以便”。 【语法点/词汇】so that 以便（后接句子）；in order to 后接动词原形。 【步骤】① 目的 → so that。② A. so that ✓。③ B. such that——搭配错，错。④ C. in order to——后接原形，此处是句子，错。⑤ D. as that——错。 【答案】A. so that。 【易错】so that/in order to。 【口诀/模板句】so that 以便接句子，in order to 接动词；he ran fast so that he could，目的状语 so that。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["状语从句","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】so that以便，为了赶上","【语法点/词汇】so that 以便（后接句子）；in order to 后接动词原形。","【步骤】① 目的 → so that。② A. so that ✓。③ B. such that——搭配错，错。④ C. in order to——后接原形，此处是句子，错。⑤ D. as that——错。","【口诀/模板句】so that 以便接句子，in order to 接动词；he ran fast so that he could，目的状语 so that。","【答案】so that"],"pitfalls":["选 such that（such 修饰名词，此处修饰副词 fast）","选 in order to（后接动词原形，不能接从句）","选 as that（不是正确搭配）","不知道 so that 引导目的状语从句，从句常带 can/could"],"hint":"【结论】so that 【考点】状语从句 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：状语从句。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为so that。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne67","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I have a lot of work ____ today.","options":["do","to do","doing","done"],"answer":"to do","analysis":"【审题】题干：I have a lot of work ______ today. have sth. to do。 【语法点/词汇】to do。 【步骤】① work to do。② A. do——缺 to，错。③ B. to do ✓。④ C. doing——错。⑤ D. done——错。 【答案】B. to do。 【易错】have sth. doing。 【口诀/模板句】have work to do 有事做，to do 后置定语；today 将要做，to do 不要换成 doing。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】work to do，不定式","【语法点/词汇】to do。","【步骤】① work to do。② A. do——缺 to，错。③ B. to do ✓。④ C. doing——错。⑤ D. done——错。","【口诀/模板句】have work to do 有事做，to do 后置定语；today 将要做，to do 不要换成 doing。","【答案】to do"],"pitfalls":["选 do（缺 to，不定式不能省）","选 doing（have sth to do 结构要用不定式）","选 done（过去分词不合结构）","不知道 have sth to do 是固定结构"],"hint":"【结论】to do 【考点】非谓语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：非谓语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为to do。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne68","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"非谓语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The teacher made us ____ the classroom.","options":["clean","to clean","cleaning","cleaned"],"answer":"clean","analysis":"【审题】题干：The teacher made us ______ the classroom. make sb. do（不带 to）。 【语法点/词汇】make/let/have sb. do。 【步骤】① made us clean。② A. clean ✓。③ B. to clean——make 不带 to，错。④ C. cleaning——错。⑤ D. cleaned——错。 【答案】A. clean。 【易错】make sb. to do。 【口诀/模板句】make sb. do 裸奔，to 不能加中间；made us clean 被迫做，make let have 不带 to。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["非谓语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make sb do省to，clean","【语法点/词汇】make/let/have sb. do。","【步骤】① made us clean。② A. clean ✓。③ B. to clean——make 不带 to，错。④ C. cleaning——错。⑤ D. cleaned——错。","【口诀/模板句】make sb. do 裸奔，to 不能加中间；made us clean 被迫做，make let have 不带 to。","【答案】clean"],"pitfalls":["选 to clean（make sb do 结构中宾补不带 to）","选 cleaning（make sb doing 不是正确结构）","选 cleaned（过去分词表被动，与 us 主动打扫不符）","不知道 make sb do sth（让某人做某事）用动词原形"],"hint":"【结论】clean 【考点】非谓语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：非谓语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为clean。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne71","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He is ____ for the meeting.","options":["responsible","response","responsibility","responsible to"],"answer":"responsible","analysis":"【审题】题干：He is ______ for the meeting. be responsible for。 【语法点/词汇】responsible 形容词。 【步骤】① be responsible for。② A. responsible ✓。③ B. response——名词，错。④ C. responsibility——名词，错。⑤ D. responsible to——to 后缺宾语，结构不全，错。 【答案】A. responsible。 【易错】词性。 【口诀/模板句】responsible for 负责，形容词 be responsible；response 名词 responsibility 责任，词性判断要仔细。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】responsible for，responsible","【语法点/词汇】responsible 形容词。","【步骤】① be responsible for。② A. responsible ✓。③ B. response——名词，错。④ C. responsibility——名词，错。⑤ D. responsible to——to 后缺宾语，结构不全，错。","【口诀/模板句】responsible for 负责，形容词 be responsible；response 名词 responsibility 责任，词性判断要仔细。","【答案】responsible"],"pitfalls":["选 response（名词，不能作 is 后的表语）","选 responsibility（名词，不能作表语）","选 responsible to（be responsible to sb 是对某人负责，本题是 for the meeting）","不知道 be responsible for sth 是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】responsible 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为responsible。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne72","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The priis too ____ for me.","options":["high","expensive","dear","cheap"],"answer":"high","analysis":"【审题】题干：The priis too ______ for me. 价格“高”用 high，不用 expensive。 【语法点/词汇】priis high/low；物 is expensive/cheap。 【步骤】① pri+ high。② A. high ✓。③ B. expensive——主语应是物，错。④ C. dear——表“贵”少修饰 price，错。⑤ D. cheap——反义，错。 【答案】A. high。 【易错】priexpensive。 【口诀/模板句】prihigh/low 搭配，物 expensive/cheap；The priis high，价格高低用 high。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】price high，价格高，high","【语法点/词汇】price is high/low；物 is expensive/cheap。","【步骤】① price + high。② A. high ✓。③ B. expensive——主语应是物，错。④ C. dear——表“贵”少修饰 price，错。⑤ D. cheap——反义，错。","【口诀/模板句】price high/low 搭配，物 expensive/cheap；The price is high，价格高低用 high。","【答案】high"],"pitfalls":["选 expensive（expensive 不用于 price，price 只能说 high/low）","选 dear（dear 指物品贵，不修饰 price）","选 cheap（与 too...for me 的语义相反）","题干 OCR 粘连（priis 应为 price），不知道 price 与 high/low 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】high 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为high。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne73","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I ____ a mistake.","options":["did","made","took","had"],"answer":"made","analysis":"【审题】题干：I ______ a mistake. make a mistake（犯错）。 【语法点/词汇】make a mistake。 【步骤】① made a mistake。② A. did——错。③ B. made ✓。④ C. took——错。⑤ D. had——错。 【答案】B. made。 【易错】do a mistake。 【口诀/模板句】make a mistake 犯个错，made a mistake 过去式；do take had 不搭 mistake，make mistake 记心里。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make a mistake，made","【语法点/词汇】make a mistake。","【步骤】① made a mistake。② A. did——错。③ B. made ✓。④ C. took——错。⑤ D. had——错。","【口诀/模板句】make a mistake 犯个错，made a mistake 过去式；do take had 不搭 mistake，make mistake 记心里。","【答案】made"],"pitfalls":["选 did（do a mistake 不成立）","选 took（take a mistake 不成立）","选 had（have a mistake 不表「犯错误」）","不知道 make a mistake（犯错误）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】made 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为made。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne74","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ attention to your spelling.","options":["pay","take","give","make"],"answer":"pay","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ attention to your spelling. pay attention to。 【语法点/词汇】pay attention to。 【步骤】① pay attention to。② A. pay ✓。③ B. take——take attention 少见，错。④ C. give——give attention 非标准，错。⑤ D. make——错。 【答案】A. pay。 【易错】pay/take attention。 【口诀/模板句】pay attention to 注意，固定搭配 pay attention；take give make 不配 attention，pay attention to spelling。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】pay attention，pay","【语法点/词汇】pay attention to。","【步骤】① pay attention to。② A. pay ✓。③ B. take——take attention 少见，错。④ C. give——give attention 非标准，错。⑤ D. make——错。","【口诀/模板句】pay attention to 注意，固定搭配 pay attention；take give make 不配 attention，pay attention to spelling。","【答案】pay"],"pitfalls":["选 take（take attention 不成立）","选 give（give attention 不表「注意」）","选 make（不搭配）","不知道 pay attention to（注意）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】pay 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为pay。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne76","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The problem is easy to ____.","options":["solve","answer","reply","deal"],"answer":"solve","analysis":"【审题】题干：The problem is easy to ______. solve the problem。 【语法点/词汇】solve 解决（问题）；answer 回答；reply 回复；deal 应对（with）。 【步骤】① problem → solve。② A. solve ✓。③ B. answer——answer the question，不搭 problem，错。④ C. reply——reply to，错。⑤ D. deal——deal with，缺 with，错。 【答案】A. solve。 【易错】solve/answer。 【口诀/模板句】solve problem 解决问题，answer question 回答题；reply to deal with，easy to solve。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】solve problem，solve","【语法点/词汇】solve 解决（问题）；answer 回答；reply 回复；deal 应对（with）。","【步骤】① problem → solve。② A. solve ✓。③ B. answer——answer the question，不搭 problem，错。④ C. reply——reply to，错。⑤ D. deal——deal with，缺 with，错。","【口诀/模板句】solve problem 解决问题，answer question 回答题；reply to deal with，easy to solve。","【答案】solve"],"pitfalls":["选 answer（answer 常接 question，problem 用 solve）","选 reply（reply 需接 to，且多指回信）","选 deal（deal 需接 with）","不知道 solve a problem（解决问题）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】solve 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为solve。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne77","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She ____ a good education.","options":["received","accepted","got","took"],"answer":"received","analysis":"【审题】题干：She ______ a good education. “接受”教育。 【语法点/词汇】receive an education（接受教育）。 【步骤】① receive education。② A. received ✓。③ B. accepted——accept 是主观接受（offer），错。④ C. got——get education 少见，错。⑤ D. took——错。 【答案】A. received。 【易错】receive/accept。 【口诀/模板句】receive education 接教育，receive 客观 accept 主观；received a good education，教育用 receive。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】receive education，received","【语法点/词汇】receive an education（接受教育）。","【步骤】① receive education。② A. received ✓。③ B. accepted——accept 是主观接受（offer），错。④ C. got——get education 少见，错。⑤ D. took——错。","【口诀/模板句】receive education 接教育，receive 客观 accept 主观；received a good education，教育用 receive。","【答案】received"],"pitfalls":["选 accepted（accept 意为「接受」，教育是被「获得」的）","选 got（get 不如 receive 正式，本题考固定搭配）","选 took（不搭配）","不知道 receive an education（接受教育）是固定搭配"],"hint":"【结论】received 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为received。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne78","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I am ____ tired today.","options":["a bit","a bit of","bit","bits"],"answer":"a bit","analysis":"【审题】题干：I am ______ tired today. 修饰形容词 tired 用 a bit（有点）。 【语法点/词汇】a bit + adj.；a bit of + 名词。 【步骤】① a bit tired。② A. a bit ✓。③ B. a bit of——后接名词，错。④ C. bit——缺冠词，错。⑤ D. bits——复数，错。 【答案】A. a bit。 【易错】a bit/a bit of。 【口诀/模板句】a bit tired 有点累，a bit of 加名词；a bit of water 一点水，a bit + 形容词。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】a bit tired，a bit修饰形容词","【语法点/词汇】a bit + adj.；a bit of + 名词。","【步骤】① a bit tired。② A. a bit ✓。③ B. a bit of——后接名词，错。④ C. bit——缺冠词，错。⑤ D. bits——复数，错。","【口诀/模板句】a bit tired 有点累，a bit of 加名词；a bit of water 一点水，a bit + 形容词。","【答案】a bit"],"pitfalls":["选 a bit of（后接名词，tired 是形容词）","选 bit（缺 a，且 bit 不能直接修饰形容词）","选 bits（复数形式不合）","不知道 a bit 修饰形容词，a bit of 修饰不可数名词"],"hint":"【结论】a bit 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为a bit。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne79","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"There is ____ water in the bottle.","options":["a little","little","a few","few"],"answer":"a little","analysis":"【审题】题干：There is ______ water in the bottle. water 不可数，肯定“有一点”。 【语法点/词汇】a little 一点（肯定）；little 几乎没有（否定）。 【步骤】① 肯定有一点水 → a little。② A. a little ✓。③ B. little——否定“几乎没有”，错。④ C. a few——接可数，错。⑤ D. few——接可数，错。 【答案】A. a little。 【易错】a little/little。 【口诀/模板句】a little 一点肯定，little 几乎没有；a few few 接可数，water 用 a little。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】a little不可数，肯定","【语法点/词汇】a little 一点（肯定）；little 几乎没有（否定）。","【步骤】① 肯定有一点水 → a little。② A. a little ✓。③ B. little——否定“几乎没有”，错。④ C. a few——接可数，错。⑤ D. few——接可数，错。","【口诀/模板句】a little 一点肯定，little 几乎没有；a few few 接可数，water 用 a little。","【答案】a little"],"pitfalls":["选 little（little 表否定「几乎没有」，与 There is 的肯定语义矛盾）","选 a few（只能修饰可数名词复数）","选 few（同样只能修饰可数名词）","不知道 water 不可数，要用 a little 修饰"],"hint":"【结论】a little 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为a little。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne80","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"词汇辨析","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"He has ____ friends, so he often feels lonely.","options":["few","a few","little","a little"],"answer":"few","analysis":"【审题】题干：He has ______ friends, so he often feels lonely. lonely 暗示朋友“几乎没有”。 【语法点/词汇】few 几乎没有（可数否定）；a few 有几个（肯定）。 【步骤】① lonely → 几乎没朋友 → few。② A. few ✓。③ B. a few——肯定“有几个”，与 lonely 矛盾，错。④ C. little——不可数，错。⑤ D. a little——不可数，错。 【答案】A. few。 【易错】few/a few。 【口诀/模板句】few 几乎没有表否定，a few 有几个肯定；lonely 暗示 few friends，few friends feels lonely。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["词汇辨析","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】few可数否定，孤独，few","【语法点/词汇】few 几乎没有（可数否定）；a few 有几个（肯定）。","【步骤】① lonely → 几乎没朋友 → few。② A. few ✓。③ B. a few——肯定“有几个”，与 lonely 矛盾，错。④ C. little——不可数，错。⑤ D. a little——不可数，错。","【口诀/模板句】few 几乎没有表否定，a few 有几个肯定；lonely 暗示 few friends，few friends feels lonely。","【答案】few"],"pitfalls":["选 a few（表「有一些」，与 feels lonely 的语境相反）","选 little（修饰不可数名词）","选 a little（修饰不可数名词）","看不出「经常感到孤独」提示朋友「几乎没有」，应用表否定的 few"],"hint":"【结论】few 【考点】词汇辨析 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：词汇辨析。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为few。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne91","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"The old building was ____ last year.","options":["pulled down","pulled up","pulled out","pulled over"],"answer":"pulled down","analysis":"【审题】题干：The old building was ______ last year. 旧楼被“拆除”。 【语法点/词汇】pull down 拆除；pull up 拉起；pull out 拔出；pull over 靠边停车。 【步骤】① 旧楼拆除 → pulled down。② A. pulled down ✓。③ B. pulled up——错。④ C. pulled out——错。⑤ D. pulled over——错。 【答案】A. pulled down。 【易错】pull 短语。 【口诀/模板句】pull down 拆房子，was pulled down 被拆；pull up 拉起 out 拔 over 停，old building down。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】pull down拆除建筑","【语法点/词汇】pull down 拆除；pull up 拉起；pull out 拔出；pull over 靠边停车。","【步骤】① 旧楼拆除 → pulled down。② A. pulled down ✓。③ B. pulled up——错。④ C. pulled out——错。⑤ D. pulled over——错。","【口诀/模板句】pull down 拆房子，was pulled down 被拆；pull up 拉起 out 拔 over 停，old building down。","【答案】pulled down"],"pitfalls":["选 pulled up（意为「停下」）","选 pulled out（意为「驶出/撤出」）","选 pulled over（意为「靠边停车」）","不知道 pull down 意为「拆除」，与 old building 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】pulled down 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为pulled down。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne92","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"Please ____ the form first.","options":["fill out","fill in","fill up","fill with"],"answer":"fill out","analysis":"【审题】题干：Please ______ the form first. 填表。 【语法点/词汇】fill out 填整张表。 【步骤】① fill out the form。② A. fill out ✓。③ B. fill in——也可，但本题④ C. fill up——装满，错。⑤ D. fill with——充满，错。 【答案】A. fill out。 【易错】fill in/out。 【口诀/模板句】fill out 填整表，the form 前 fill out；fill in 填空 up 装满 with 充，fill out form。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】fill out填表","【语法点/词汇】fill out 填整张表。","【步骤】① fill out the form。② A. fill out ✓。③ B. fill in——也可，但本题答案 out。④ C. fill up——装满，错。⑤ D. fill with——充满，错。","【口诀/模板句】fill out 填整表，the form 前 fill out；fill in 填空 up 装满 with 充，fill out form。","【答案】fill out"],"pitfalls":["选 fill in（fill in 侧重点某一项，本题宾语是完整 form）","选 fill up（装满）","选 fill with（用…装满，结构不符）","不知道 fill out the form（填写整张表格）是常用搭配"],"hint":"【结论】fill out 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为fill out。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne93","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"She has ____ a lot of progress.","options":["made","done","had","taken"],"answer":"made","analysis":"【审题】题干：She has ______ a lot of progress. make progress（取得进步）。 【语法点/词汇】make progress。 【步骤】① has made progress。② A. made ✓。③ B. done——错。④ C. had——错。⑤ D. taken——错。 【答案】A. made。 【易错】do progress。 【口诀/模板句】make progress 取进步，has made a lot of progress；do had taken 不搭 progress，make progress 记住。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】make progress，made","【语法点/词汇】make progress。","【步骤】① has made progress。② A. made ✓。③ B. done——错。④ C. had——错。⑤ D. taken——错。","【口诀/模板句】make progress 取进步，has made a lot of progress；do had taken 不搭 progress，make progress 记住。","【答案】made"],"pitfalls":["选 done（do progress 不成立）","选 had（不搭配）","选 taken（不搭配）","不知道 make progress（取得进步）是固定搭配，且 progress 不可数"],"hint":"【结论】made 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为made。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne94","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"I will ____ the matter right away.","options":["look into","look up","look for","look after"],"answer":"look into","analysis":"【审题】题干：I will ______ the matter right away. “调查”这件事。 【语法点/词汇】look into 调查；look up 查阅；look for 寻找；look after 照顾。 【步骤】① 调查 matter → look into。② A. look into ✓。③ B. look up——查字典，错。④ C. look for——寻找，错。⑤ D. look after——照顾，错。 【答案】A. look into。 【易错】look 短语。 【口诀/模板句】look into 调查事，look up 查阅词；look for 寻找 after 照顾，look into the matter。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】look into调查，look into","【语法点/词汇】look into 调查；look up 查阅；look for 寻找；look after 照顾。","【步骤】① 调查 matter → look into。② A. look into ✓。③ B. look up——查字典，错。④ C. look for——寻找，错。⑤ D. look after——照顾，错。","【口诀/模板句】look into 调查事，look up 查阅词；look for 寻找 after 照顾，look into the matter。","【答案】look into"],"pitfalls":["选 look up（查阅/抬头）","选 look for（寻找）","选 look after（照顾）","不知道 look into 意为「调查」，与 the matter 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】look into 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为look into。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ne95","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-vocab","knowledgePoint":"动词短语","type":"choice","typeLabel":"单选","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"My sister ____ my children when I am away.","options":["looks after","looks for","looks up","looks out"],"answer":"looks after","analysis":"【审题】题干：My sister ______ my children when I am away. 我不在，姐姐“照顾”孩子。 【语法点/词汇】look after 照顾。 【步骤】① 照顾 children → looks after。② A. looks after ✓。③ B. looks for——寻找，错。④ C. looks up——查阅，错。⑤ D. looks out——小心，错。 【答案】A. looks after。 【易错】look 短语。 【口诀/模板句】look after 照顾人，looks after my children；look for 寻找 up 查 out 小心，look after 记。","source":"2027考纲补充","tags":["动词短语","考纲补充"],"steps":["【秒懂考点】look after照顾，looks after","【语法点/词汇】look after 照顾。","【步骤】① 照顾 children → looks after。② A. looks after ✓。③ B. looks for——寻找，错。④ C. looks up——查阅，错。⑤ D. looks out——小心，错。","【口诀/模板句】look after 照顾人，looks after my children；look for 寻找 up 查 out 小心，look after 记。","【答案】looks after"],"pitfalls":["选 looks for（寻找）","选 looks up（查阅）","选 looks out（小心/向外看）","不知道 look after 意为「照顾」，与 children 搭配"],"hint":"【结论】looks after 【考点】动词短语 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：动词短语。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为looks after。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"en4103","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-4","knowledgePoint":"see sb doing","type":"single","typeLabel":"单选","stem":"I saw him ____ across the street.","options":["walking","walk","to walk","walked"],"answer":"walking","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"高频","source":"new2026","tags":["非谓语","感官动词"],"analysis":"【审题】题干：I saw him ______ across the street. see sb. doing（看见正在做）。 【语法点/词汇】see sb. do / doing。 【步骤】① 看见他正在过街 → walking。② A. walking ✓（选项只有 walking，且题干考 see sb. doing）。③ 其他形式 walk/to walk/walked 不是本题答案。④ see him walking 强调动作片段。 【答案】walking。 【易错】see him walk（全过程）。 【口诀/模板句】see sb. doing 片段，walking 正在穿；I saw him walking across，see him doing 记。","steps":["【秒懂考点】see sb doing看见正在过，walking","【语法点/词汇】see sb. do / doing。","【步骤】① 看见他正在过街 → walking。② A. walking ✓（选项只有 walking，且题干考 see sb. doing）。③ 其他形式 walk/to walk/walked 不是本题答案。④ see him walking 强调动作片段。","【口诀/模板句】see sb. doing 片段，walking 正在穿；I saw him walking across，see him doing 记。","【答案】walking"],"pitfalls":["选 walk（see sb do 表看到全过程，see sb doing 表看到正在进行）","选 to walk（see 后的宾补不带 to）","选 walked（过去分词表被动，与主动走不符）","分不清 see sb do 与 see sb doing 的语义差别"],"hint":"【结论】walking 【考点】see sb doing 【一步步怎么算】 ① 读题干定位考点：see sb doing。② 逐项排除错误选项。③ 正确答案为walking。"});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"et01","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：It is necessary for us to master a foreign language.","answer":"我们有必要掌握一门外语。","accept":["我们掌握一门外语是必要的"],"sample":"参考译文：我们有必要掌握一门外语。","scorePoints":["It is necessary for sb to do 结构译对","master 译为“掌握”而非“主人”","语序通顺"],"pitfalls":["漏译 necessary（必要性），只译成「我们掌握一门外语」","把 for us 误译成「为了我们」（此处是逻辑主语）","把 It is necessary for sb to do 结构硬译成「它是必要的」，主语错位","把 master 译成「主人」（master 作动词是「掌握」）"],"tags":["翻译","形式主语"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】我们有必要掌握一门外语。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：It is necessary for us to master a foreign lan。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：It is necessary for us to master a foreign language. 【语法点/词汇】It is + adj. + for sb. + to do（对某人来说做……是……的）；master 掌握；foreign language 外语。 【步骤】① 主干：It is necessary（这是必要的）。② for us（对我们来说）。③ to master a foreign language（掌握一门外语）。④ 汉语语序：对我们来说掌握一门外语是必要的 → 我们有必要掌握一门外语。⑤ 调整语序使中文通顺。 【答案】我们有必要掌握一门外语。 【易错】直译“它是必要的给我们”；master 译成“主人”。 【口诀/模板句】It is adj. for sb. to do，先译动作再译性质；master 掌握 foreign 外语，语序调整成中文。","steps":["【秒懂考点】英译汉：It is necessary for sb to do","【第一步】it是形式主语，真正主语是to master a foreign language","【第二步】necessary必要，master掌握，foreign language外语","【第三步】翻译：我们有必要掌握一门外语"]});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"et02","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：We cannot learn a language well without enough practice.","answer":"没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。","accept":["没有充分练习我们就无法学好一门语言"],"sample":"参考译文：没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。","scorePoints":["cannot…without 双重否定按中文习惯处理","practice 译“练习”","通顺"],"pitfalls":["把 without enough practice 译成条件句「如果练习不够」以外的语序","漏译 enough（足够的），只写「没有练习」","把 cannot learn a language well 译成「不能学好语言」而丢掉「一门」的量","把双重否定的语义（没有练习就学不好）翻成单纯否定"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：We cannot learn a language well without enough。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规","analysis":"【审题】题干：英译汉：We cannot learn a language well without enough practice. 【语法点/词汇】cannot…without…（没有……就不能……）双重否定表肯定条件；practi练习。 【步骤】① We cannot learn a language well（我们不能学好语言）。② without enough practice（没有足够的练习）。③ 中文习惯：没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。④ 或：我们没有足够的练习就学不好语言。 【答案】没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言。 【易错】译成双重否定“不……不……”别扭；without 漏译。 【口诀/模板句】without enough practice，先条件后结果；cannot learn well 学不好，中文语序条件前。","steps":["【秒懂考点】双重否定：cannot...without...","【第一步】cannot...without，没有……就不能……","【第二步】learn a language well学好语言，enough practice足够练习","【第三步】翻译：没有足够的练习，我们学不好一门语言"]});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"et03","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"汉译英：每天坚持练习很重要。","answer":"It is important to keep practicing every day.","accept":["It's important to practice every day.","Keeping practicing every day is important."],"sample":"参考译文：It is important to keep practicing every day.","scorePoints":["形式主语 It is adj to do 或动名词主语","keep practicing","every day"],"pitfalls":["用 It is important to do 结构时漏掉形式主语 It","把「坚持练习」译成 keep to practice（应为 keep practicing）","把 every day 写成 everyday（everyday 是形容词「日常的」）","漏译「每天」这个频率状语"],"tags":["翻译","写作句型"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】It is important to keep practicing every day. 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：汉译英：每天坚持练习很重要。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语","analysis":"【审题】题干：汉译英：每天坚持练习很重要。 【语法点/词汇】It is important to do（做……很重要）；keep doing（坚持做）；practidoing；every day 每天。 【步骤】① “很重要”→ It is important to…。② “坚持练习”→ keep practicing。③ “每天”→ every day（时间状语置后）。④ 组合：It is important to keep practicing every day. ⑤ 核对：keep practicing 坚持练习，every day 时间，结构完整。 【答案】It is important to keep practicing every day. 【易错】keep to practice（错）；practito keep；漏 every day。 【口诀/模板句】很重要 It is important to do，坚持做 keep doing；practidoing 不接 to，every day 置句后。","steps":["【秒懂考点】汉译英：It is important to do","【第一步】很重要It is important，坚持练习keep practicing","【第二步】每天every day","【第三步】It is important to keep practicing every day"]});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"et04","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：The more you practice, the better you will become.","answer":"你练习得越多，就会变得越好。","accept":["练习越多，你就会越好"],"sample":"参考译文：你练习得越多，就会变得越好。","scorePoints":["the more…the more 结构","时态","通顺"],"pitfalls":["把 the more 译成「更多」（丢掉「越…越…」结构）","两半句的「越」只译一半","把 practice 译成「实践」","语序颠倒成「你变得越好，练习得越多」"],"tags":["翻译","比较"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】你练习得越多，就会变得越好。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：The more you practice, the better you will bec。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错","analysis":"【审题】题干为「英译汉：The more you practice, the better you will become.」，考 the more…the more… 比较级叠加句式。【语法点】① the + 比较级 + 分句, the + 比较级 + 分句 = 越…就越…；② 前半句用一般现在时表条件，后半句常用将来时；③ 两个 the 都是副词，不能省略。【分步推导】前半 the more you practice → 你练习得越多（条件）；后半 the better you will become → 你就会变得越好（结果）。汉语习惯先条件后结果，与英语顺序一致。【答案】你练习得越多，就会变得越好。【易错】①两个 the 都要译成「越」，只译一个就丢掉了递进关系；②practice 在此是动词「练习」，不是名词「实践」；③不要译成「你练得更多，变得更好」——汉语的「越…越…」才是对应句式。","steps":["【秒懂考点】\"The more…, the better…\" → 越…越…（比较级叠加结构）","【第一步：断句】The more you practice, the better you will become.","【第二步：识别句型】the + 比较级…, the + 比较级… = 越…就越…","【第三步：逐半句译】The more you practice = 你练习得越多；the better you will become = 你就会变得越好","【第四步：合句润色】「你练习得越多，就会变得越好。」","【答案】你练习得越多，就会变得越好。"]});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"et05","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"汉译英：互联网使我们的生活更加便利。","answer":"The Internet makes our life more convenient.","accept":["The Internet has made our life more convenient."],"sample":"参考译文：The Internet makes our life more convenient.","scorePoints":["make + 宾语 + 形容词补语","convenient 拼写","主谓一致"],"pitfalls":["写成 make our life convenienter（convenient 的比较级是 more convenient）","把 life 写成复数 lives（此处理解为整体生活）","漏掉句首冠词 The","用 make…to be convenient（多出 to be）"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"highfreq","score":5,"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】The Internet makes our life more convenient. 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：汉译英：互联网使我们的生活更加便利。。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时","analysis":"【审题】题干为「汉译英：互联网使我们的生活更加便利。」，考 make + 宾语 + 形容词（比较级）结构。【语法点】① make + 宾语 + adj = 使…变得…；② convenient 是多音节形容词，比较级用 more convenient 而非加 -er；③ 「我们的生活」译 our life（表整体生活状态，用单数）。【分步推导】主语 The Internet → 谓语 makes（三单）→ 宾语 our life → 宾补 more convenient。合成：The Internet makes our life more convenient.【答案】The Internet makes our life more convenient.【易错】①convenient 是典型的「多音节形容词」，不能写 convenienter（同类还有 more beautiful、more important）；②make 作使役动词时后接「宾语 + 形容词」，不加 to be、不加 to do；③句末别漏句号。","steps":["【秒懂考点】汉译英：「使…更…」用 make + 宾语 + 形容词比较级","【第一步：定主谓】主语「互联网」= The Internet；谓语「使」= makes","【第二步：定宾语】「我们的生活」= our life（life 作「生活」不可数，用单数）","【第三步：定补语】「更加便利」= more convenient（convenient 是多音节词，比较级用 more）","【第四步：合成并检查】The Internet makes our life more convenient.","【答案】The Internet makes our life more convenient."]});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id":"ex20","module":"public","subject":"英语","chapter":"ch-en-5","knowledgePoint":"翻译与写作","type":"translate","typeLabel":"翻译","difficulty":2,"difficultyLabel":"强化","stem":"英译汉：Practimakes perfect.","answer":"熟能生巧。","accept":["熟能生巧"],"sample":"参考译文：熟能生巧。","scorePoints":["固定谚语","通顺"],"tags":["翻译"],"source":"batch","score":5,"pitfalls":["直译成「练习使完美」（不符合中文表达习惯）","把 practice 译成「实践」（此处指反复练习）","漏掉句末句号","把 perfect 译成「完全」而丢掉「巧」的含义"],"explainLevel":"subject-specific","hint":"【结论】熟能生巧。 【考点】翻译与写作 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：英译汉：Practimakes perfect.。 ② 定位考点：翻译与写作。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 熟能生巧。。 【易错】注意","analysis":"【审题】题干为「英译汉：Practice makes perfect.」。注：原题干「Practimakes perfect.」为 OCR 缺失空格所致，正确原文是 Practice makes perfect.【语法点】① practice 作名词表「练习、反复训练」；② make + 宾语 + 形容词 = 使…变得…；③ 这是英语常用谚语，已有固定汉语对应表达。【分步推导】Practice（练习）+ makes（使…成为）+ perfect（完美）→「练习造就完美」。汉语里对等的成语是「熟能生巧」，比直译更地道、也更符合谚语翻译的要求。【答案】熟能生巧。【易错】①谚语翻译优先找汉语中已有的对应成语，直译虽不错但失分（「练习使完美」不如「熟能生巧」）；②practice 在动词义里是「练习」，在名词义里也常译「实践」，本句是「反复做」的意思，不是「社会实践」。本题与 ne210 为同一谚语的两道题（重复训练），可对照记忆。","steps":["【秒懂考点】\"Practice makes perfect\" → 熟能生巧（英语谚语，直译「练习造就完美」）","【第一步：先断词】题干原文为 Practice makes perfect。注：原题干「Practimakes perfect.」为 OCR 缺空格误识，正确应为 Practice makes perfect.","【第二步：逐词定意】Practice = 练习；makes = 使…成为/造就；perfect = 完美的","【第三步：合句】\"练习（能）造就完美\" → 中文对应成语「熟能生巧」","【第四步：不要直译成「练习使完美」】直译生硬，汉语里最贴切的固定说法就是「熟能生巧」","【答案】熟能生巧。"]});
